(4279377, 617148, 84520, '<td valign="top">What I like most about this image is the contrast of the deep, tea-infused water with the dominant white background.  The effect is unique, and it works well.  Also, the ''overflow'' is well captured.  I would have excluded the lemon slice because it''s distracting, and then you could have all of the viewers attention focused on the tea.  Either that, or put the slice in the glass, on the rim--that way, it has utility and enhances the image</td>', 'What I like most about this image is the contrast of the deep, tea-infused water with the dominant white background.  The effect is unique, and it works well.  Also, the ''overflow'' is well captured.  I would have excluded the lemon slice because it''s distracting, and then you could have all of the viewers attention focused on the tea.  Either that, or put the slice in the glass, on the rim--that way, it has utility and enhances the image', '2007-12-01 00:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279378, 611583, 42013, '<td valign="top">You continue to raise the bar. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-09 23:52:09.</i></td>', 'You continue to raise the bar. ', '2007-12-01 00:18:22.000000', '2007-12-09 23:52:09.000000', 1),
(4279379, 618549, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and tones!!  I love the frosted glass.</td>', 'Nice colors and tones!!  I love the frosted glass.', '2007-12-01 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279381, 618082, 32872, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful horse.  I love Arabians.  He certainly has a beautiful head and neck!</td>', 'What a beautiful horse.  I love Arabians.  He certainly has a beautiful head and neck!', '2007-12-01 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279383, 609542, 84520, '<td valign="top">I think the colors could be emphasized more.  I think a single capture HDR would work great to capture the shadow detail you''ve lost in the boats keel, and would help keep the cloud highlights from being blown out as much.  Also, you can do a background clone/layer overlay with shadow/highlight adjustments for a similar effect</td>', 'I think the colors could be emphasized more.  I think a single capture HDR would work great to capture the shadow detail you''ve lost in the boats keel, and would help keep the cloud highlights from being blown out as much.  Also, you can do a background clone/layer overlay with shadow/highlight adjustments for a similar effect', '2007-12-01 00:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279384, 618346, 42013, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of nshapiro''s work. I really like your framing.</td>', 'Reminds me of nshapiro''s work. I really like your framing.', '2007-12-01 00:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279385, 618286, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love a good lighthouse picture, but because they''re usually on beautiful and interesting pieces of coast, I wish you had shown us more of the lighthouse''s surroundings.  Sunsets and sunrises also work well with lighthouses.  Currently, nothing -really- captures my attention and makes me say "wow!  thats amazing!"</td>', 'I love a good lighthouse picture, but because they''re usually on beautiful and interesting pieces of coast, I wish you had shown us more of the lighthouse''s surroundings.  Sunsets and sunrises also work well with lighthouses.  Currently, nothing -really- captures my attention and makes me say "wow!  thats amazing!"', '2007-12-01 00:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279386, 618239, 56503, '<td valign="top">Seems to be quite out of focus. Sorry.</td>', 'Seems to be quite out of focus. Sorry.', '2007-12-01 00:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279390, 615530, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve used dodge/burn to frame the girl.   Her color contrasts well with the background, and is overall the result of good composition.  Well done</td>', 'I like how you''ve used dodge/burn to frame the girl.   Her color contrasts well with the background, and is overall the result of good composition.  Well done', '2007-12-01 00:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279391, 612793, 32872, '<td valign="top">OH my!!  This is certainly a glowing winner.  It has the wow factor, the technicalities are perfect, the vibrant colors and nice composition are stunning.  I just want to look at the amazing water!!  Very nice image.</td>', 'OH my!!  This is certainly a glowing winner.  It has the wow factor, the technicalities are perfect, the vibrant colors and nice composition are stunning.  I just want to look at the amazing water!!  Very nice image.', '2007-12-01 00:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279394, 616388, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is cute. She has got a mysterious look about her like she knows something both the audience and her partner do not... that''s sum sort of irony, though I forget which now... :) Nicely done. On the technical side it seems a little flat, I think it''s lacking in whiter white areas...</td>', 'This is cute. She has got a mysterious look about her like she knows something both the audience and her partner do not... that''s sum sort of irony, though I forget which now... :) Nicely done. On the technical side it seems a little flat, I think it''s lacking in whiter white areas...', '2007-12-01 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279395, 614109, 84520, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors!  You''ll have to share your post processing secrets.</td>', 'Fantastic colors!  You''ll have to share your post processing secrets.', '2007-12-01 00:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279399, 617015, 32872, '<td valign="top">My type of image!  Nicely done and such a cute little fella!  Is this the effect you achieve by putting a small hole in your lenscap?  Cool if so...</td>', 'My type of image!  Nicely done and such a cute little fella!  Is this the effect you achieve by putting a small hole in your lenscap?  Cool if so...', '2007-12-01 00:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279402, 618169, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous - fabulous image with fantastic processing to bring out such great textures and tones</td>', 'This is gorgeous - fabulous image with fantastic processing to bring out such great textures and tones', '2007-12-01 00:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279404, 613975, 32872, '<td valign="top">This has wonderful, geometric shapes and great composition!</td>', 'This has wonderful, geometric shapes and great composition!', '2007-12-01 00:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279406, 618035, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot... I really like the look of it and the use of light. though I don''t know what to make of this on the conceptual level. If I were to just look at her I''d get the impression that she was lost and confused, possibly ran from the wedding or had her fiancee run from her. But then having him in the photo looking at her adds a strange dynamic that throws my scenario out the window... perhaps if he were looking upset if would have made more sense...</td>', 'This is an interesting shot... I really like the look of it and the use of light. though I don''t know what to make of this on the conceptual level. If I were to just look at her I''d get the impression that she was lost and confused, possibly ran from the wedding or had her fiancee run from her. But then having him in the photo looking at her adds a strange dynamic that throws my scenario out the window... perhaps if he were looking upset if would have made more sense...', '2007-12-01 00:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279408, 613237, 32872, '<td valign="top">Great stop action!</td>', 'Great stop action!', '2007-12-01 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279412, 618238, 68947, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!!!!!!!!', '2007-12-01 00:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279413, 615734, 84520, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sunset, but your foreground is too dark and is thus distracting.  Use a shadow/highlight mask in photoshop (Judi''s infrared tutorial explains this process very well, along with other post processing tricks).  The mask would let us see more detail in the foreground.</td>', 'Fantastic sunset, but your foreground is too dark and is thus distracting.  Use a shadow/highlight mask in photoshop (Judi''s infrared tutorial explains this process very well, along with other post processing tricks).  The mask would let us see more detail in the foreground.', '2007-12-01 00:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279414, 617708, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is the first image that I got from my start on voting. It''s gotta go downhill from here! What a gorgeous, well executed entry! Just lovely. So ethereal. 9</td>', 'This is the first image that I got from my start on voting. It''s gotta go downhill from here! What a gorgeous, well executed entry! Just lovely. So ethereal. 9', '2007-12-01 00:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
