(4279618, 617850, 84520, '<td valign="top">Wow!  It''s not often you see a woman standing behind a ring of fire.   She may be a bit blurry, but that comes with the territory on these types of shots--7</td>', 'Wow!  It''s not often you see a woman standing behind a ring of fire.   She may be a bit blurry, but that comes with the territory on these types of shots--7', '2007-12-01 01:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
