(4279621, 609975, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love it!  The plant is beautiful, and your lighting does a good job of capturing the subtle details in the leaves</td>', 'I love it!  The plant is beautiful, and your lighting does a good job of capturing the subtle details in the leaves', '2007-12-01 01:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
