(4279657, 618569, 48928, '<td valign="top">I wish this had more punch to it... perhaps a boost in contrast or a unique perspective?</td>', 'I wish this had more punch to it... perhaps a boost in contrast or a unique perspective?', '2007-12-01 01:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
