(4279660, 618544, 48928, '<td valign="top">some of the reflections in the water are a little distracting to me, otherwise a nice composed shot</td>', 'some of the reflections in the water are a little distracting to me, otherwise a nice composed shot', '2007-12-01 01:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279661, 608676, 48928, '<td valign="top">those clouds are amazing</td>', 'those clouds are amazing', '2007-12-01 01:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279666, 609837, 60173, '<td valign="top">The idea of this shot is actually quite moving. <br/> <br/>I would say I''m not sold on the post processing, but I actually think shooting this at a different time of the day would help drastically. There''s some pretty harsh light on her fare skin.<br/> <br/>I might have cloned out the bush creeping in from the left next to the tree. Otherwise I really like the composition.</td>', 'The idea of this shot is actually quite moving.  I would say I''m not sold on the post processing, but I actually think shooting this at a different time of the day would help drastically. There''s some pretty harsh light on her fare skin. I might have cloned out the bush creeping in from the left next to the tree. Otherwise I really like the composition.', '2007-12-01 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279668, 618314, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great colors, the HDR/tonemap effect works wonders here.  Well composed, well executed...but those clouds, man, they''re mindblowing!  And the water looks fantastic as well.  Easy 10.</td>', 'Great colors, the HDR/tonemap effect works wonders here.  Well composed, well executed...but those clouds, man, they''re mindblowing!  And the water looks fantastic as well.  Easy 10.', '2007-12-01 01:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279671, 618346, 84520, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  I like how you''ve included the foreground tree in the composition, while keeping it in focus and not overwhelming the image.  That is a very, very difficult thing to do.  Likewise, the tone range is superb, and the radiant lighting looks excellent--9</td>', 'Wonderful.  I like how you''ve included the foreground tree in the composition, while keeping it in focus and not overwhelming the image.  That is a very, very difficult thing to do.  Likewise, the tone range is superb, and the radiant lighting looks excellent--9', '2007-12-01 01:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279673, 617117, 63398, '<td valign="top">Good color, but a tad muted, though I cannot tell you how to fix that. 6</td>', 'Good color, but a tad muted, though I cannot tell you how to fix that. 6', '2007-12-01 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279675, 618486, 84520, '<td valign="top">You have great material to work with, I just wish there had been more post processing.  A background duplication with a layer overlay, shadow/highlight mask, and some tweaking of curves would bring out those sunset colors and make this image stand out.  As is, its a 6 but could easily be an 8.</td>', 'You have great material to work with, I just wish there had been more post processing.  A background duplication with a layer overlay, shadow/highlight mask, and some tweaking of curves would bring out those sunset colors and make this image stand out.  As is, its a 6 but could easily be an 8.', '2007-12-01 01:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279676, 612302, 48928, '<td valign="top">I really like this as an IR image... makes it pop... the tree in the composition seems a little bit off to me though... great shot otherwise though</td>', 'I really like this as an IR image... makes it pop... the tree in the composition seems a little bit off to me though... great shot otherwise though', '2007-12-01 01:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279680, 616087, 63398, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but it''s a unique and pleasing image.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but it''s a unique and pleasing image.', '2007-12-01 01:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279689, 615638, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love the soft diffusion of light, but it seems like too much of this image is behind a haze.  I like layers of haze because there''s a great contrast between what is in focus and what is hazy, but here the haze effect is overwhelming.  Overall, well composed--6</td>', 'I love the soft diffusion of light, but it seems like too much of this image is behind a haze.  I like layers of haze because there''s a great contrast between what is in focus and what is hazy, but here the haze effect is overwhelming.  Overall, well composed--6', '2007-12-01 01:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279691, 618274, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love the blood diffusion in the water, but I don''t think you can sign your images on DPC...</td>', 'I love the blood diffusion in the water, but I don''t think you can sign your images on DPC...', '2007-12-01 01:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279693, 618335, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve split the background between a lit, white surface and a fading grey into black.  Too many images such as this have a sold ''look you guys, i''ve found pure WHITE'' background, and the curve of the white with the curve of the leaves looks great.   Also, the leaves are a stunning red.  Great composition and capture--8</td>', 'I like how you''ve split the background between a lit, white surface and a fading grey into black.  Too many images such as this have a sold ''look you guys, i''ve found pure WHITE'' background, and the curve of the white with the curve of the leaves looks great.   Also, the leaves are a stunning red.  Great composition and capture--8', '2007-12-01 01:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279696, 617455, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love the image, but I would have cut the white border.  The image holds its own without the border, which is a little too large and distracting--7</td>', 'I love the image, but I would have cut the white border.  The image holds its own without the border, which is a little too large and distracting--7', '2007-12-01 01:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279699, 615714, 84520, '<td valign="top">You''ll have to tell us how you created this unique and interesting image</td>', 'You''ll have to tell us how you created this unique and interesting image', '2007-12-01 01:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279700, 612437, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but your foreground is too dark.  Try using a shadow/highlight mask to tease out the details--currently, its a distracting black mass.</td>', 'Great colors, but your foreground is too dark.  Try using a shadow/highlight mask to tease out the details--currently, its a distracting black mass.', '2007-12-01 01:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279704, 618469, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great texture on the clouds.  Your horizon is a bit tilted, and you can easily fix that in PS.  Under the eyedroper tool, select ''measure'', and drag the little line across your horizon, making sure to line it up on both ends so that it follows your horizon.  Then go to ''image---&gt;rotate----&gt;arbitrary''.  It will tell you the angle the image will be rotated, press OK.  You''ll get funny white spaces on every side which you have to crop out, but honestly, I think a tilted horizon is not worth the price of a little bit of your image.</td>', 'Great texture on the clouds.  Your horizon is a bit tilted, and you can easily fix that in PS.  Under the eyedroper tool, select ''measure'', and drag the little line across your horizon, making sure to line it up on both ends so that it follows your horizon.  Then go to ''image--->rotate---->arbitrary''.  It will tell you the angle the image will be rotated, press OK.  You''ll get funny white spaces on every side which you have to crop out, but honestly, I think a tilted horizon is not worth the price of a little bit of your image.', '2007-12-01 01:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279707, 614902, 48928, '<td valign="top">Good nature shot... just doesn''t quite pop out to me</td>', 'Good nature shot... just doesn''t quite pop out to me', '2007-12-01 01:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279708, 618212, 84520, '<td valign="top">This looks like Alex; given the swans, soft diffusion of light, blue tones, and an overall excellent image.  I don''t know that the tree adds much to your image, and part of me wants to see the sky and the moon (since it IS a moonlight serenade).</td>', 'This looks like Alex; given the swans, soft diffusion of light, blue tones, and an overall excellent image.  I don''t know that the tree adds much to your image, and part of me wants to see the sky and the moon (since it IS a moonlight serenade).', '2007-12-01 01:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279709, 618414, 48928, '<td valign="top">I like your different perspective but the colors seem a little bit flat  to me</td>', 'I like your different perspective but the colors seem a little bit flat  to me', '2007-12-01 01:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279711, 618453, 48928, '<td valign="top">it seems like there is an overlay in this image?  The eyes are captivating though, but something seems unnatural??</td>', 'it seems like there is an overlay in this image?  The eyes are captivating though, but something seems unnatural??', '2007-12-01 01:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279713, 618169, 84520, '<td valign="top">Fantastic HDR effect here.   While I like the composition, I want the tree in the top right to be gone so I could see more of the sky, and possibly the sun.</td>', 'Fantastic HDR effect here.   While I like the composition, I want the tree in the top right to be gone so I could see more of the sky, and possibly the sun.', '2007-12-01 01:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279714, 615359, 48928, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections and variations in color.  The image is very divided in composition, and I am somewhat undecided on weather I like it or not...</td>', 'I like the reflections and variations in color.  The image is very divided in composition, and I am somewhat undecided on weather I like it or not...', '2007-12-01 01:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279715, 618456, 48928, '<td valign="top">good lighting, soft and even over the model</td>', 'good lighting, soft and even over the model', '2007-12-01 01:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279716, 617056, 84520, '<td valign="top">Great night shot.  If you''re from around here, you should (this is me being nitpicky) have come back every night until you got a perfect reflection!  But I won''t fault you for me being obsessive--7</td>', 'Great night shot.  If you''re from around here, you should (this is me being nitpicky) have come back every night until you got a perfect reflection!  But I won''t fault you for me being obsessive--7', '2007-12-01 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279717, 612564, 48928, '<td valign="top">interesting and kinda abstract... curious what flower or plant this is?</td>', 'interesting and kinda abstract... curious what flower or plant this is?', '2007-12-01 02:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279719, 617738, 84520, '<td valign="top">Well composed, but I wish the light was softer.  Perhaps a different angle, or a gaussian blur.</td>', 'Well composed, but I wish the light was softer.  Perhaps a different angle, or a gaussian blur.', '2007-12-01 02:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279720, 615150, 48928, '<td valign="top">reflection is nice and town/city is quite pretty</td>', 'reflection is nice and town/city is quite pretty', '2007-12-01 02:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279721, 616713, 84520, '<td valign="top">Fantastic reflection.  You could probably have coaxed more out of the image with an overlay layer on the background, and a shadow/highlight mask on the sky.  A different shadow/highlight mask would probably be needed for the buildings and trees, but there''s alot of tonal potential here that I feel just isn''t realized</td>', 'Fantastic reflection.  You could probably have coaxed more out of the image with an overlay layer on the background, and a shadow/highlight mask on the sky.  A different shadow/highlight mask would probably be needed for the buildings and trees, but there''s alot of tonal potential here that I feel just isn''t realized', '2007-12-01 02:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279723, 613480, 48928, '<td valign="top">I like the color on focus on the eye, I wish I could have seen more in focus :)</td>', 'I like the color on focus on the eye, I wish I could have seen more in focus :)', '2007-12-01 02:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279725, 617904, 48928, '<td valign="top">a little grainy for my personal taste</td>', 'a little grainy for my personal taste', '2007-12-01 02:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279729, 618197, 84520, '<td valign="top">So is this frozen blue water, in stacked wine glasses?  I''ve always wondered about the technique that creates this effect.    Whatever you did to creat it, you did it well</td>', 'So is this frozen blue water, in stacked wine glasses?  I''ve always wondered about the technique that creates this effect.    Whatever you did to creat it, you did it well', '2007-12-01 02:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
