(4279736, 616660, 84520, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to preserve the detail on the water, coax out a fantastic red/orange sunset, and you woke up early in the morning to get this image, which earns points in my book.</td>', 'You''ve managed to preserve the detail on the water, coax out a fantastic red/orange sunset, and you woke up early in the morning to get this image, which earns points in my book.', '2007-12-01 02:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
