(4279758, 618183, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but your depth of sharpness needs some work.  Use a high aperture, and a prime focus lens (like a 50mm) to get crisp and razor sharp images.  Currently, the apple (which is one of the main subjects) to the left is too blurry.</td>', 'I like the composition, but your depth of sharpness needs some work.  Use a high aperture, and a prime focus lens (like a 50mm) to get crisp and razor sharp images.  Currently, the apple (which is one of the main subjects) to the left is too blurry.', '2007-12-01 02:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
