(4279849, 618238, 52130, '<td valign="top">amazing...i do wish there was a little more space above her head...but other than that i love it</td>', 'amazing...i do wish there was a little more space above her head...but other than that i love it', '2007-12-01 04:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279852, 618005, 52130, '<td valign="top">huh, amazingly i like this! a lot..huh</td>', 'huh, amazingly i like this! a lot..huh', '2007-12-01 04:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279854, 616960, 52130, '<td valign="top">cool!</td>', 'cool!', '2007-12-01 04:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279855, 608659, 69368, '<td valign="top">beuatuiful image! The tones are just right! Well done!</td>', 'beuatuiful image! The tones are just right! Well done!', '2007-12-01 04:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279856, 617743, 77543, '<td valign="top">Is this a self-portrait challenge outtake?</td>', 'Is this a self-portrait challenge outtake?', '2007-12-01 04:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279860, 618018, 4517, '<td valign="top">Is that real? there so close.</td>', 'Is that real? there so close.', '2007-12-01 05:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279868, 617588, 84520, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a good job capturing the range of highlights in the image.  This doesn''t look like a posed image, and in my experiance its really hard to capture your intended emotion/situation without some planning/posing.   Currently, the emotional punch just isn''t hitting hard enough.  That being said, you do a great job with the image you had--7</td>', 'You''ve done a good job capturing the range of highlights in the image.  This doesn''t look like a posed image, and in my experiance its really hard to capture your intended emotion/situation without some planning/posing.   Currently, the emotional punch just isn''t hitting hard enough.  That being said, you do a great job with the image you had--7', '2007-12-01 05:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279869, 613108, 84520, '<td valign="top">The image is too flat.  I would recommend reshooting with an artificial light source, directed across the records--you''ll get some nice contrast and depth to the image. Toy around with some extra light (or higher exposures) and see what you like</td>', 'The image is too flat.  I would recommend reshooting with an artificial light source, directed across the records--you''ll get some nice contrast and depth to the image. Toy around with some extra light (or higher exposures) and see what you like', '2007-12-01 05:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279870, 618470, 84520, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, but I would like to see more detail in the rock jetty and on the tree horizon.   I don''t know if ashadow/highlights mask would work with your capture, but give it a shot.  Right now, you have an amazing sky and a lackluster foreground that is distracting me from the sunset--and it shouldnt.</td>', 'I love the colors, but I would like to see more detail in the rock jetty and on the tree horizon.   I don''t know if ashadow/highlights mask would work with your capture, but give it a shot.  Right now, you have an amazing sky and a lackluster foreground that is distracting me from the sunset--and it shouldnt.', '2007-12-01 05:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279872, 618466, 84520, '<td valign="top">So sharp I could cut myself--except for the river, of course.  I think you could tease some more highlights from the bridge with some heavier burning and dodging; however, what you currently have is excellent--7</td>', 'So sharp I could cut myself--except for the river, of course.  I think you could tease some more highlights from the bridge with some heavier burning and dodging; however, what you currently have is excellent--7', '2007-12-01 05:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279873, 617276, 84520, '<td valign="top">This just isnt capturing my attention.  I like the setup, but I wish she was facing the viewer.  Right now, I just don''t connect.  However, you''ve done a nice job with the platform, making sure the light fades out on the bottom, right, and top.</td>', 'This just isnt capturing my attention.  I like the setup, but I wish she was facing the viewer.  Right now, I just don''t connect.  However, you''ve done a nice job with the platform, making sure the light fades out on the bottom, right, and top.', '2007-12-01 05:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279874, 616628, 84520, '<td valign="top">I want to see the whole engine!  I''m sure its beautiful, and the range you could coax out of all that old metal with a single capture HDR and some dodging/burning would be spectacular.</td>', 'I want to see the whole engine!  I''m sure its beautiful, and the range you could coax out of all that old metal with a single capture HDR and some dodging/burning would be spectacular.', '2007-12-01 05:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279875, 618030, 84520, '<td valign="top">Maybe its my monitor, but I''m noticing darker tones (not white) in the upper left hand corner only; its advanced editing so you should just clone that out.   Also, there''s quite a bit of white space in this image, and you''d be better of filling the frame a bit more with your model. That minor detail aside, I think this is a unique and interesting take on nudes--naked but not naked.</td>', 'Maybe its my monitor, but I''m noticing darker tones (not white) in the upper left hand corner only; its advanced editing so you should just clone that out.   Also, there''s quite a bit of white space in this image, and you''d be better of filling the frame a bit more with your model. That minor detail aside, I think this is a unique and interesting take on nudes--naked but not naked.', '2007-12-01 05:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279877, 618541, 84520, '<td valign="top">The cherries aren''t in a sharp enough focus.  When I''m working with a very narrow depth of field, I find its useful to use a tripod--that way, I wont unfocus my image by breathing (or steping back slightly).</td>', 'The cherries aren''t in a sharp enough focus.  When I''m working with a very narrow depth of field, I find its useful to use a tripod--that way, I wont unfocus my image by breathing (or steping back slightly).', '2007-12-01 05:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279878, 618256, 84520, '<td valign="top">Although I don''t mind the distortion from the wide angle lens, I wish that the tree was parked right in the middle of the frame.  Right now, it''s not centered nor is it following the rule of thirds--and while your sunset colors are amazing, that minor compositional detail is distracting.   I like how you chose to include the field of rocks in your image, it gives a nice sense of depth and space.  Overall, a nice image--7</td>', 'Although I don''t mind the distortion from the wide angle lens, I wish that the tree was parked right in the middle of the frame.  Right now, it''s not centered nor is it following the rule of thirds--and while your sunset colors are amazing, that minor compositional detail is distracting.   I like how you chose to include the field of rocks in your image, it gives a nice sense of depth and space.  Overall, a nice image--7', '2007-12-01 05:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279880, 618287, 84520, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love the colors--maybe it was your intent to ''frame'' the sunset with the dark trees, but I would like to see more detail there.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I love the colors--maybe it was your intent to ''frame'' the sunset with the dark trees, but I would like to see more detail there.', '2007-12-01 05:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279881, 613351, 84520, '<td valign="top">An animal that isn''t a deer--a winner in my book.   The diffusion of light works well here, it makes the putty tat look very soft and cuddly...although that would be a bad idea :)</td>', 'An animal that isn''t a deer--a winner in my book.   The diffusion of light works well here, it makes the putty tat look very soft and cuddly...although that would be a bad idea :)', '2007-12-01 05:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279883, 608273, 84520, '<td valign="top">...And light there was.  <br/> <br/> <br/>What an amazing red.</td>', '...And light there was.    What an amazing red.', '2007-12-01 05:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279885, 618566, 80594, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.. wonderful light and shadow</td>', 'Simple and elegant.. wonderful light and shadow', '2007-12-01 05:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279886, 617870, 84520, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve slightly over-blurred the background clouds.  They contrast nicely with the waves (which are very, very sharp) but I want to see just a little more cloud detail.</td>', 'I think you''ve slightly over-blurred the background clouds.  They contrast nicely with the waves (which are very, very sharp) but I want to see just a little more cloud detail.', '2007-12-01 05:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279887, 618518, 84520, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That man has my respect</td>', 'Wow.  That man has my respect', '2007-12-01 05:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279888, 618473, 80594, '<td valign="top">wonderful silhouette, warm color and feel</td>', 'wonderful silhouette, warm color and feel', '2007-12-01 05:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279889, 614456, 80594, '<td valign="top">very dramtic and full of energy and motion</td>', 'very dramtic and full of energy and motion', '2007-12-01 05:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279890, 617609, 80594, '<td valign="top">wonderful feel and reflection... has a serene quality</td>', 'wonderful feel and reflection... has a serene quality', '2007-12-01 05:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279891, 618224, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I wish the (moon?) was clearer.  I know that was probably impossible given that the halo comes from suspended ice crystals that refract the light (and also blur the moon), but I can dream...always easier to be a critic!  However, you''ve captured a unique effect well, and your composition is spot on--7</td>', 'I like it, but I wish the (moon?) was clearer.  I know that was probably impossible given that the halo comes from suspended ice crystals that refract the light (and also blur the moon), but I can dream...always easier to be a critic!  However, you''ve captured a unique effect well, and your composition is spot on--7', '2007-12-01 05:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279892, 617548, 84520, '<td valign="top">Where can I get one :)</td>', 'Where can I get one :)', '2007-12-01 05:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279893, 618196, 80594, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition and detail, well done in 2 tone</td>', 'Awesome composition and detail, well done in 2 tone', '2007-12-01 05:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279894, 611131, 80594, '<td valign="top">great colors and energy, but leaves my eyes wandering to much</td>', 'great colors and energy, but leaves my eyes wandering to much', '2007-12-01 05:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279896, 618368, 80594, '<td valign="top">breath taking shot</td>', 'breath taking shot', '2007-12-01 05:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279897, 618389, 80594, '<td valign="top">wonderful study of texture and shadow</td>', 'wonderful study of texture and shadow', '2007-12-01 05:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279898, 612793, 84520, '<td valign="top">Never having been to london, I don''t know where you shot this...but managing to capture that ferris wheel, parlement, big ben, and that bridge simms likes to take pictures of...all with great reflections=well done in my book.<br/> <br/>Maybe this is obsessive, but the light on big ben and the parliment makes both seem out of focus.  maybe its a lens issue (50mm!  you cant go wrong with one of those!) or maybe you just need to shadow highlight mask it, but it is a tad distracting--7</td>', 'Never having been to london, I don''t know where you shot this...but managing to capture that ferris wheel, parlement, big ben, and that bridge simms likes to take pictures of...all with great reflections=well done in my book. Maybe this is obsessive, but the light on big ben and the parliment makes both seem out of focus.  maybe its a lens issue (50mm!  you cant go wrong with one of those!) or maybe you just need to shadow highlight mask it, but it is a tad distracting--7', '2007-12-01 05:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4279899, 616261, 80594, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and feel</td>', 'Beautiful colors and feel', '2007-12-01 05:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
