(4280440, 618572, 74371, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! Well setup and wonderfully focussed. In a day wrought with cell-phones, electric hair curlers and so on, your choice of accessories is especially grand. Wonderful, all-around photography. Your choice of a model for this was outstanding. The emotion and total young lady look that she has put forth makes this shot go from a good shot to great!! Congrats!! (9)</td>', 'I love this shot! Well setup and wonderfully focussed. In a day wrought with cell-phones, electric hair curlers and so on, your choice of accessories is especially grand. Wonderful, all-around photography. Your choice of a model for this was outstanding. The emotion and total young lady look that she has put forth makes this shot go from a good shot to great!! Congrats!! (9)', '2007-12-01 12:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
