(4280583, 618453, 70369, '<td valign="top">I like the border and the exposure on the face.. I wish it was so contrasty because on my monitor I lose a lot of detail around the arms.. Still Nice job.</td>', 'I like the border and the exposure on the face.. I wish it was so contrasty because on my monitor I lose a lot of detail around the arms.. Still Nice job.', '2007-12-01 14:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280585, 616590, 70369, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better for me if the bushes were the focal point and less foreground. beautiful colors</td>', 'I think this would have worked better for me if the bushes were the focal point and less foreground. beautiful colors', '2007-12-01 14:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280587, 609975, 70369, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the entire flower in very sharp focus with the blurred background.. The leaves off to the right are a tad bit distracting because the are so out of focus compared to the left side.. imho 6</td>', 'I would have liked to see the entire flower in very sharp focus with the blurred background.. The leaves off to the right are a tad bit distracting because the are so out of focus compared to the left side.. imho 6', '2007-12-01 14:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280588, 608966, 70369, '<td valign="top">perfect. 10</td>', 'perfect. 10', '2007-12-01 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280590, 610149, 70369, '<td valign="top">Too much black foreground for me.. I like the blur of the lights, but if the worker was in sharp focus, it would have really worked better for me..imho</td>', 'Too much black foreground for me.. I like the blur of the lights, but if the worker was in sharp focus, it would have really worked better for me..imho', '2007-12-01 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280591, 618571, 70369, '<td valign="top">I really would have preferred to see the center in very sharp focus.. Looks like there may have been a little motion blur wich imho takes away from the beauty of the shot.</td>', 'I really would have preferred to see the center in very sharp focus.. Looks like there may have been a little motion blur wich imho takes away from the beauty of the shot.', '2007-12-01 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280595, 613108, 70369, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this in full color.. The contrast of the black records against the dying leaves would have been more interesting to look at. imho  I do like the vignette and the idea.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this in full color.. The contrast of the black records against the dying leaves would have been more interesting to look at. imho  I do like the vignette and the idea.', '2007-12-01 14:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280596, 618486, 70369, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot.. I think I would have liked to see a bump in saturation on this.. Maybe bring out the yellows and the reds to really make it pop. 6</td>', 'Pretty shot.. I think I would have liked to see a bump in saturation on this.. Maybe bring out the yellows and the reds to really make it pop. 6', '2007-12-01 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280598, 615888, 70369, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a drop.. The white glare or maybe it''s cream is distracting. Beautiful colors though in the base of the drop. 6</td>', 'Great capture of a drop.. The white glare or maybe it''s cream is distracting. Beautiful colors though in the base of the drop. 6', '2007-12-01 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280600, 618319, 70369, '<td valign="top">This has a really blue tone to it, which makes it feel cold.. Maybe some white balance or a filter added to warmen in up would have made it better for me. imho.. Love is red, hot and passionate.. 5</td>', 'This has a really blue tone to it, which makes it feel cold.. Maybe some white balance or a filter added to warmen in up would have made it better for me. imho.. Love is red, hot and passionate.. 5', '2007-12-01 14:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280601, 612780, 70369, '<td valign="top">fricken awesome. I love the sky, the sharpness.. It''s perfect.. Well done. 10</td>', 'fricken awesome. I love the sky, the sharpness.. It''s perfect.. Well done. 10', '2007-12-01 14:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280602, 610462, 70369, '<td valign="top">Darling little boy.. I love the pose. The expression on his face.. The focus looks perfect to me too.. I do wish it was in color.. It''s just my humble opinion, but I prefer to see kids in color.. 8 for me.</td>', 'Darling little boy.. I love the pose. The expression on his face.. The focus looks perfect to me too.. I do wish it was in color.. It''s just my humble opinion, but I prefer to see kids in color.. 8 for me.', '2007-12-01 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280635, 615078, 87160, '<td valign="top"><b>Wowwww love this image, how did you do it very impressive.</b></td>', 'Wowwww love this image, how did you do it very impressive.', '2007-12-01 14:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280651, 617050, 87160, '<td valign="top">Great location, fab shot</td>', 'Great location, fab shot', '2007-12-01 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280653, 617095, 29177, '<td valign="top">I love this in black and white... the focus is right where it needs to be on the eye and the sharpness is good. You caught an intense look in his/her eyes that is captivating. You upped the cuteness factor with him/her peeking out from under the blanket. The lighting is very pleasing :) Not sure... but it appears you had to do some work on the shaded eye to bring it back out of the shadows.... Im not sure this was necessary for this shot.... I think it could have stood well without doing that or just bringing it out less. Overall very well done!</td>', 'I love this in black and white... the focus is right where it needs to be on the eye and the sharpness is good. You caught an intense look in his/her eyes that is captivating. You upped the cuteness factor with him/her peeking out from under the blanket. The lighting is very pleasing :) Not sure... but it appears you had to do some work on the shaded eye to bring it back out of the shadows.... Im not sure this was necessary for this shot.... I think it could have stood well without doing that or just bringing it out less. Overall very well done!', '2007-12-01 14:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280655, 617802, 29177, '<td valign="top">I really love the leading lines in this shot. Leaving the person on the bridge breaks it up and adds interest. Overall I like the toning.... just maybe a tad less. Lovely shot.... well done.</td>', 'I really love the leading lines in this shot. Leaving the person on the bridge breaks it up and adds interest. Overall I like the toning.... just maybe a tad less. Lovely shot.... well done.', '2007-12-01 14:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280658, 618212, 5354, '<td valign="top">This is the blue ribbon, in my opinion anyway ;-)<br/>Great image</td>', 'This is the blue ribbon, in my opinion anyway ;-)Great image', '2007-12-01 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280660, 618585, 29177, '<td valign="top">Fantastic action shot! Love the intensity in the Matador''s face and body language! The colors are beautiful! I like the action blur on the bull. Im not sure about the crop..... I wonder if you had to crop it so tightly because there was something you needed to crop out that was distracting. If not... a little more room would have been nice. Beautifully done :)</td>', 'Fantastic action shot! Love the intensity in the Matador''s face and body language! The colors are beautiful! I like the action blur on the bull. Im not sure about the crop..... I wonder if you had to crop it so tightly because there was something you needed to crop out that was distracting. If not... a little more room would have been nice. Beautifully done :)', '2007-12-01 14:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280662, 611583, 5354, '<td valign="top">Stunning, absolutely stunning deserves a ribbon at least.</td>', 'Stunning, absolutely stunning deserves a ribbon at least.', '2007-12-01 14:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280668, 613237, 5354, '<td valign="top">Good but in the FS comp not close to a ribbon.<br/>Would have like to see her face, maybe step a few feet to the left. Nice shadow, but probably not spotted by many people.</td>', 'Good but in the FS comp not close to a ribbon.Would have like to see her face, maybe step a few feet to the left. Nice shadow, but probably not spotted by many people.', '2007-12-01 14:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280669, 618097, 29177, '<td valign="top">These shots always amaze me! The detail is so interesting. The color and sharpness are all there.... I like the DOF.... just wish there was more light on the body so I could see a bit more the insect''s wings. Well done!</td>', 'These shots always amaze me! The detail is so interesting. The color and sharpness are all there.... I like the DOF.... just wish there was more light on the body so I could see a bit more the insect''s wings. Well done!', '2007-12-01 14:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280674, 617609, 69368, '<td valign="top">nice scenery; like the tones</td>', 'nice scenery; like the tones', '2007-12-01 14:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280675, 617694, 5354, '<td valign="top">Landscapes/seascapes need drama, this lack any real atmosphere and is therefore just a record shot of the white cliffs. Can only give it a 6 at best.</td>', 'Landscapes/seascapes need drama, this lack any real atmosphere and is therefore just a record shot of the white cliffs. Can only give it a 6 at best.', '2007-12-01 14:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280676, 617850, 29177, '<td valign="top">SWEEEEET shot! Dont know if this was attention to detail or a happy accident.... its excellent that the fire ring echos the patterns on the walls! Really excellent shot! Bumping it up after my second look :)</td>', 'SWEEEEET shot! Dont know if this was attention to detail or a happy accident.... its excellent that the fire ring echos the patterns on the walls! Really excellent shot! Bumping it up after my second look :)', '2007-12-01 14:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4280679, 618189, 5354, '<td valign="top">I like this, but it has some real gems to run against in the FS.<br/>Great composition and I like the IR treatment.</td>', 'I like this, but it has some real gems to run against in the FS.Great composition and I like the IR treatment.', '2007-12-01 14:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
