(4280695, 618344, 46782, '<td valign="top">This is such a great face... I don''t think color is the way to go - Maybe a sepia tone or Black and White - Still, one of my favorites. THe expression is perfect.</td>', 'This is such a great face... I don''t think color is the way to go - Maybe a sepia tone or Black and White - Still, one of my favorites. THe expression is perfect.', '2007-12-01 14:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
