(4281496, 615175, 1031, '<td valign="top">This is a soft (in feeling, not focus), subdued scene with no particular point of attention, a place calling for a quiet contemplation which the typical speed voter rejects. They (seem to) want to be hit by something obvious, splashy, bright or bewitching, not something which makes them want to sit down and write poetry about the meaning of life.<br/> <br/>The colors and lighting give it a very painterly look, but without a recognizable landmark or distinctive feature it becomes just another lovely landscape shot to most people. I can picture it as a stock image found in pre-packaged picture frames; an instantly-recognizable yet anonymous scene. It''s evocative, but unfortunately, (of course -- it''s a little digital picture!) not to the degree you felt when you were there.<br/> <br/>I think this is "well above average" and a fine piece, perhaps even earning a bonus for daring to go where DPC voters fear to tread.</td>', 'This is a soft (in feeling, not focus), subdued scene with no particular point of attention, a place calling for a quiet contemplation which the typical speed voter rejects. They (seem to) want to be hit by something obvious, splashy, bright or bewitching, not something which makes them want to sit down and write poetry about the meaning of life. The colors and lighting give it a very painterly look, but without a recognizable landmark or distinctive feature it becomes just another lovely landscape shot to most people. I can picture it as a stock image found in pre-packaged picture frames; an instantly-recognizable yet anonymous scene. It''s evocative, but unfortunately, (of course -- it''s a little digital picture!) not to the degree you felt when you were there. I think this is "well above average" and a fine piece, perhaps even earning a bonus for daring to go where DPC voters fear to tread.', '2007-12-01 23:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4281497, 618314, 74209, '<td valign="top">Clouds are a dramatic counterpoint to the rocks.  There is so much motion in the sky and sea that the rocks seem almost alive. 9</td>', 'Clouds are a dramatic counterpoint to the rocks.  There is so much motion in the sky and sea that the rocks seem almost alive. 9', '2007-12-01 23:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
