(4282052, 617704, 63398, '<td valign="top">Although a decent enough shot of the buck, I find all the junk in the background takes way too much from this image for my tastes. With this being an advanced editing challenge, I would have cloned that all out. That would have made for excellent negative space.</td>', 'Although a decent enough shot of the buck, I find all the junk in the background takes way too much from this image for my tastes. With this being an advanced editing challenge, I would have cloned that all out. That would have made for excellent negative space.', '2007-12-02 05:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282053, 614391, 72318, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, must have been some effort to get this down.  Something about the perspective is a bit strange tho - i know the frame is probably dead centre and facing the camera spot on, but it doesnt "appear" to be.  Not sure if that is a bad thing or not ;)</td>', 'Nice idea, must have been some effort to get this down.  Something about the perspective is a bit strange tho - i know the frame is probably dead centre and facing the camera spot on, but it doesnt "appear" to be.  Not sure if that is a bad thing or not ;)', '2007-12-02 05:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282054, 618026, 63398, '<td valign="top">Just a truly lovely peaceful and serene image. I really like the extra substance of the branch and its reflection in the foreground. One of the finer entries IMO. 8</td>', 'Just a truly lovely peaceful and serene image. I really like the extra substance of the branch and its reflection in the foreground. One of the finer entries IMO. 8', '2007-12-02 05:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
