(4282081, 615721, 72318, '<td valign="top">The lamp shade is a bit too dark creating a very large area of wasted space imo - maybe if it was a dark shade of grey it wouldnt impose too much on the subject but would add something more to the image so that the space up there wasnt so bleak.</td>', 'The lamp shade is a bit too dark creating a very large area of wasted space imo - maybe if it was a dark shade of grey it wouldnt impose too much on the subject but would add something more to the image so that the space up there wasnt so bleak.', '2007-12-02 06:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
