(4282084, 618571, 30982, '<td valign="top">Since the center part of the rose is the darkest in color, that''s where the eye goes (at least mine) and one wants to find that a little more in focus.  Not crisp, necessarily - soft is fine - just a bit less blur.  Nice light and color.</td>', 'Since the center part of the rose is the darkest in color, that''s where the eye goes (at least mine) and one wants to find that a little more in focus.  Not crisp, necessarily - soft is fine - just a bit less blur.  Nice light and color.', '2007-12-02 06:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
