(4282086, 613643, 72318, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The bit i like is how the plane is framed in one of the panels and is completely not part of the composition in the classical sense but is just "there".  Nice job in B&amp;W</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The bit i like is how the plane is framed in one of the panels and is completely not part of the composition in the classical sense but is just "there".  Nice job in B&W', '2007-12-02 06:06:58.000000', NULL, 1);
