(4282093, 610084, 30982, '<td valign="top">A stumper.  First, it''s a great shot of this thing - wonderful sky.  But now I can''t figure the reflection - or is she not a reflection and standing in front of the thing?  Hopefully folks will stop long enough to enjoy the conundrum!</td>', 'A stumper.  First, it''s a great shot of this thing - wonderful sky.  But now I can''t figure the reflection - or is she not a reflection and standing in front of the thing?  Hopefully folks will stop long enough to enjoy the conundrum!', '2007-12-02 06:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282094, 618187, 72318, '<td valign="top">Hrm - was about to say that the eyes are too dark, but reading the title i can now say that the smile is a bit "off" for what i think you were trying to achieve. Lovely textures and postwork :)</td>', 'Hrm - was about to say that the eyes are too dark, but reading the title i can now say that the smile is a bit "off" for what i think you were trying to achieve. Lovely textures and postwork :)', '2007-12-02 06:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
