(4282104, 610246, 49109, '<td valign="top">good composition and processing, the greens are slightly oversaturated though. trunk of tree could show some more midtones.</td>', 'good composition and processing, the greens are slightly oversaturated though. trunk of tree could show some more midtones.', '2007-12-02 06:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
