(4282118, 618119, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky!  I like it in black and white, too.  If I were to be picky, it would be that the sky is so very nice and crisp but your foreground subjects seem a tad soft.  Still, I like it.</td>', 'Wonderful sky!  I like it in black and white, too.  If I were to be picky, it would be that the sky is so very nice and crisp but your foreground subjects seem a tad soft.  Still, I like it.', '2007-12-02 06:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282119, 618183, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nicely presented still life - I like just that one curly bit of cinnamon in focus.  Nice different approach.</td>', 'A nicely presented still life - I like just that one curly bit of cinnamon in focus.  Nice different approach.', '2007-12-02 06:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282120, 617081, 72318, '<td valign="top">A bit too much saturation postwork has turned the sky one of two colours: yellow or red - with hardly any in between... posterisation i think it is called going by the filter in PS which does this for you :( Composition is cool tho.</td>', 'A bit too much saturation postwork has turned the sky one of two colours: yellow or red - with hardly any in between... posterisation i think it is called going by the filter in PS which does this for you :( Composition is cool tho.', '2007-12-02 06:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
