(4282621, 618352, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is probably just me, but I generally associate cold tones and colors with colder expressions.  A beautiful sunny smile like this needs a warmer tone to evoke a warmer feeling?  Still, a great shot - I''m sure she''s pleased.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is probably just me, but I generally associate cold tones and colors with colder expressions.  A beautiful sunny smile like this needs a warmer tone to evoke a warmer feeling?  Still, a great shot - I''m sure she''s pleased.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-02 12:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
