(4282634, 617329, 29009, '<td valign="top">This probably could have benefited if the background was even more softly focused.  This time of day is particularly difficult to expose people, it looks a tad underexposed on the people and a bit over on the sky.  The construction items in the background aren''t helping your theme of love.  This was a good idea for a subject, looks like you were somewhere having a great time!</td>', 'This probably could have benefited if the background was even more softly focused.  This time of day is particularly difficult to expose people, it looks a tad underexposed on the people and a bit over on the sky.  The construction items in the background aren''t helping your theme of love.  This was a good idea for a subject, looks like you were somewhere having a great time!', '2007-12-02 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282636, 617095, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, this is cute.A beautiful dog in a great shot! The b + w works well</td>', 'oh, this is cute.A beautiful dog in a great shot! The b + w works well', '2007-12-02 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
