(4282782, 615359, 36060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections and colours.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections and colours.', '2007-12-02 13:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282784, 618396, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2007-12-02 13:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282785, 618493, 36060, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!</td>', 'Excellent shot!', '2007-12-02 13:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282790, 618569, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a more interesting perspective that straight dead on - so kudos for trying to be interesting.  To me, this screams for black and white treatment.  The blue on the truck competes with the blue in the sky, and needs a teeny bit more contrast to break out the white bar and the GMC logo.  I love that the side mirrors are different.  :)  The frame overall lacks depth; ordinarily I recommend shooting from an angle to show the long and wide sides of the subject to achieve that, but I see that you might have been going for a "smack at you" effect which does work here, as I do have a bit of a feeling like I''m about to get run over but wait (!) the truck is dead and abandoned.  Phew.  :)</td>', 'This is a more interesting perspective that straight dead on - so kudos for trying to be interesting.  To me, this screams for black and white treatment.  The blue on the truck competes with the blue in the sky, and needs a teeny bit more contrast to break out the white bar and the GMC logo.  I love that the side mirrors are different.  :)  The frame overall lacks depth; ordinarily I recommend shooting from an angle to show the long and wide sides of the subject to achieve that, but I see that you might have been going for a "smack at you" effect which does work here, as I do have a bit of a feeling like I''m about to get run over but wait (!) the truck is dead and abandoned.  Phew.  :)', '2007-12-02 13:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282791, 618314, 36060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!', '2007-12-02 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282793, 611583, 36060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!', '2007-12-02 13:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282797, 616209, 36060, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!</td>', 'Excellent shot!', '2007-12-02 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282798, 618388, 29009, '<td valign="top">I can see basic rules of composition at work here with the placement of the horizon line and the rays of light.  Something is missing though, perhaps it''s visual drama or perhaps the whole thing is just a bit too blue?  When I put my hand over the left side of the frame, I found I didn''t miss it as part of the overal composition.  The true focal point is the rays of light, and that should take up more of the frame.  Overall, it''s a decent image that with some different cropping could be even better.</td>', 'I can see basic rules of composition at work here with the placement of the horizon line and the rays of light.  Something is missing though, perhaps it''s visual drama or perhaps the whole thing is just a bit too blue?  When I put my hand over the left side of the frame, I found I didn''t miss it as part of the overal composition.  The true focal point is the rays of light, and that should take up more of the frame.  Overall, it''s a decent image that with some different cropping could be even better.', '2007-12-02 13:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282800, 609975, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2007-12-02 13:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
