(4282802, 618097, 29009, '<td valign="top">A shiver just went up my spine.  Nice job with the macro detail - definitely evoked an emotion with me!  :)</td>', 'A shiver just went up my spine.  Nice job with the macro detail - definitely evoked an emotion with me!  :)', '2007-12-02 13:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282803, 616316, 36060, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot, great colours.</td>', 'Brilliant shot, great colours.', '2007-12-02 13:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282805, 615638, 36060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!', '2007-12-02 13:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282808, 618251, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that needs more in the background for context, or to tell a story.  Otherwise, it''s an ordinary perspective of a duck, with good technical detail and lighting but there''s really no visual drama here, or anything to evoke an emotion.  Overall, I can see basic rules of composition were met and there is definitely technical merit here; I''m just not feeling any emotional attachment to the subject or location.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that needs more in the background for context, or to tell a story.  Otherwise, it''s an ordinary perspective of a duck, with good technical detail and lighting but there''s really no visual drama here, or anything to evoke an emotion.  Overall, I can see basic rules of composition were met and there is definitely technical merit here; I''m just not feeling any emotional attachment to the subject or location.', '2007-12-02 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282809, 617254, 36060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, great colours.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, great colours.', '2007-12-02 13:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282811, 617802, 36060, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2007-12-02 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282812, 617903, 29009, '<td valign="top">This seems a tad underexposed/lacking in contrast, but the facial expression is priceless and you''ve definitely captured personality here.</td>', 'This seems a tad underexposed/lacking in contrast, but the facial expression is priceless and you''ve definitely captured personality here.', '2007-12-02 13:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282816, 618346, 36060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!', '2007-12-02 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282817, 618189, 36060, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2007-12-02 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282818, 615359, 84440, '<td valign="top">extreme over-saturation. doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'extreme over-saturation. doesn''t work for me.', '2007-12-02 13:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282819, 617772, 29009, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I''m not sophisticated enough to truly appreciate astrophotography; however, I like how you''ve used or created vignetting to make the subject cluster pop.</td>', 'Perhaps I''m not sophisticated enough to truly appreciate astrophotography; however, I like how you''ve used or created vignetting to make the subject cluster pop.', '2007-12-02 13:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282820, 618384, 29009, '<td valign="top">Technicals here are well met with regard to exposure, composition, focus, etc.  I don''t mean to hurt your feelings, but this really seems like a standard portrait that you have to know the person to really like the image.  There''s no story - the girl and the cat aren''t interacting -- there''s no true personality captured or anything that makes me wish I was a) at the scene or b) knew the people in it.  Technically though, you got it spot-on.  Artistic merit - although pleasing, it''s rather ordinary.</td>', 'Technicals here are well met with regard to exposure, composition, focus, etc.  I don''t mean to hurt your feelings, but this really seems like a standard portrait that you have to know the person to really like the image.  There''s no story - the girl and the cat aren''t interacting -- there''s no true personality captured or anything that makes me wish I was a) at the scene or b) knew the people in it.  Technically though, you got it spot-on.  Artistic merit - although pleasing, it''s rather ordinary.', '2007-12-02 13:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282822, 616479, 29009, '<td valign="top">I like the high key effect and the way you''ve used angle in the composition to create visual interest.  The man suffers from floating head syndrome, though.  Overall, this image has impact and I like it, so it''s getting a good score.  :)</td>', 'I like the high key effect and the way you''ve used angle in the composition to create visual interest.  The man suffers from floating head syndrome, though.  Overall, this image has impact and I like it, so it''s getting a good score.  :)', '2007-12-02 13:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282823, 618441, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of personality.  Good use of point of view in that you aren''t looking down at the child from above. My one small nit is that because her shirt matches the doorway, she''s getting lost in it and doesn''t pop out of the frame as much as she would if she''d been wearing a different color top.  Overall, this is a very good shot.</td>', 'Excellent capture of personality.  Good use of point of view in that you aren''t looking down at the child from above. My one small nit is that because her shirt matches the doorway, she''s getting lost in it and doesn''t pop out of the frame as much as she would if she''d been wearing a different color top.  Overall, this is a very good shot.', '2007-12-02 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282826, 617847, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good use of architectural line to lead the viewers eye through the frame and to the subject; however, I just wish he was doing something more interesting.  Black and white treatment was definitely the way to go.  Good job!</td>', 'Good use of architectural line to lead the viewers eye through the frame and to the subject; however, I just wish he was doing something more interesting.  Black and white treatment was definitely the way to go.  Good job!', '2007-12-02 13:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282828, 617541, 29009, '<td valign="top">Great use of toning and color to support the facial expression.  Makes me wonder what is going on behind me!  :)</td>', 'Great use of toning and color to support the facial expression.  Makes me wonder what is going on behind me!  :)', '2007-12-02 13:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282837, 617757, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF to isolate the subject here.  The subject itself - not quite interesting enough to hold my attention.  I''m also wondering why your title references an element not present in your composition.  Overall, I can see good technicals and while there is some visual interest with the contrast between the subject and background, I''m not emotionally attached or invested in it.  Still, I''m giving a decent score because of the technical superiority.</td>', 'Good use of DOF to isolate the subject here.  The subject itself - not quite interesting enough to hold my attention.  I''m also wondering why your title references an element not present in your composition.  Overall, I can see good technicals and while there is some visual interest with the contrast between the subject and background, I''m not emotionally attached or invested in it.  Still, I''m giving a decent score because of the technical superiority.', '2007-12-02 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282856, 618441, 29177, '<td valign="top">Genuine joy! Beautiful candid capture! I love that the color of the door and her shirt work together so well.... the body language is priceless! You just have to smile when you look at this photo.... Excellent shot! Congrats :)</td>', 'Genuine joy! Beautiful candid capture! I love that the color of the door and her shirt work together so well.... the body language is priceless! You just have to smile when you look at this photo.... Excellent shot! Congrats :)', '2007-12-02 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4282861, 617455, 29177, '<td valign="top">I love that his playing the sax mirrors the ad for the iPod! Excellent composition! I like the toning and the use of negative space. Beautiful shot.... one of my top scoring shots.</td>', 'I love that his playing the sax mirrors the ad for the iPod! Excellent composition! I like the toning and the use of negative space. Beautiful shot.... one of my top scoring shots.', '2007-12-02 13:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
