(4282932, 615013, 62249, '<td valign="top">The bride''s face is too flat looking. Needs better lighting to make her face compete successfully with the flowers. Alternatively, given the intensity of the flowers, might''ve been better to crop just above the top of her dress, omitting her head &amp; shoulders so that the flowers could tell the story.</td>', 'The bride''s face is too flat looking. Needs better lighting to make her face compete successfully with the flowers. Alternatively, given the intensity of the flowers, might''ve been better to crop just above the top of her dress, omitting her head & shoulders so that the flowers could tell the story.', '2007-12-02 14:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
