(4283456, 609975, 22301, '<td valign="top">Very cool light on this plant, I like how it just hits the top of the plant. a reflector might have helped fill in those shadows on the left side. I just notice your file is only 35 kb, you can use up to 150 kb, which would make the small detail edges much smoother and less jaggedy. IF you have PS take a look at this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> for getting your images ready for challenges. Its a very cool shot but I feel you may lose points simply because if the file size(image quality) and not the image.</td>', 'Very cool light on this plant, I like how it just hits the top of the plant. a reflector might have helped fill in those shadows on the left side. I just notice your file is only 35 kb, you can use up to 150 kb, which would make the small detail edges much smoother and less jaggedy. IF you have PS take a look at this tutorial for getting your images ready for challenges. Its a very cool shot but I feel you may lose points simply because if the file size(image quality) and not the image.', '2007-12-02 18:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283459, 617381, 83313, '<td valign="top">The horizon could use some straightening and the main subject, the boats, is lost in the rest of the image. Nothing guides my eye to them. Cropping in on the boats may have helped. There are some wonderful reflections of them in the water.</td>', 'The horizon could use some straightening and the main subject, the boats, is lost in the rest of the image. Nothing guides my eye to them. Cropping in on the boats may have helped. There are some wonderful reflections of them in the water.', '2007-12-02 18:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283462, 616087, 22301, '<td valign="top">good work with the light, I don''t know if I like the red tint. Very cool pose.</td>', 'good work with the light, I don''t know if I like the red tint. Very cool pose.', '2007-12-02 18:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4283464, 618484, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and well composed. The sepia was a good choice. it''s amazing how much detail can be fit into 640 pixels sometimes.</td>', 'Nicely done and well composed. The sepia was a good choice. it''s amazing how much detail can be fit into 640 pixels sometimes.', '2007-12-02 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
