(4283948, 614786, 22301, '<td valign="top">the color and technicals are all there for me. I just wish she wasn''t quite so stiff, to me she is kind of like a doll. I think you were trying to show how proud she is to get married. Maybe showing her getting ready to walk down the aisle or some other details may have helped. As I said, its technically sound, just wish it had some more of her personality. just my opinion</td>', 'the color and technicals are all there for me. I just wish she wasn''t quite so stiff, to me she is kind of like a doll. I think you were trying to show how proud she is to get married. Maybe showing her getting ready to walk down the aisle or some other details may have helped. As I said, its technically sound, just wish it had some more of her personality. just my opinion', '2007-12-02 22:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
