(4283976, 617906, 22301, '<td valign="top">good use of negative space. But try and get your file size up as high as it can go. Your image is 21 kb and the max allowance for challenge entries is 150 kb. That would have made the details in the pumpkin really crisp and strong and get rid of those jagged edges. If you use photoshop, take a look at this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a>. It helps you get images ready for challenges. I think it will help with your scores as I see many quality images marked down for how big the file size is and not how well done the image was take. Happy shooting.</td>', 'good use of negative space. But try and get your file size up as high as it can go. Your image is 21 kb and the max allowance for challenge entries is 150 kb. That would have made the details in the pumpkin really crisp and strong and get rid of those jagged edges. If you use photoshop, take a look at this tutorial. It helps you get images ready for challenges. I think it will help with your scores as I see many quality images marked down for how big the file size is and not how well done the image was take. Happy shooting.', '2007-12-02 22:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
