(4284080, 617056, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice cityscape, love the reflections. A little tip is to try and get your images up to 150 kb. For example your image is 98 kb. Using as much as possible will make the fine details smoother like inthe details of the bridge. If you use PS, take a look at this <a href="//www." rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a>. It helps you get images ready for for challenges and show you how to make files as big as possible. Happy shooting. :)</td>', 'nice cityscape, love the reflections. A little tip is to try and get your images up to 150 kb. For example your image is 98 kb. Using as much as possible will make the fine details smoother like inthe details of the bridge. If you use PS, take a look at this tutorial. It helps you get images ready for for challenges and show you how to make files as big as possible. Happy shooting. :)', '2007-12-02 23:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284083, 618547, 70000, '<td valign="top">stunning portrait of the pair. The colors work very well together and the lighting is flawless. The family must be very pleased!</td>', 'stunning portrait of the pair. The colors work very well together and the lighting is flawless. The family must be very pleased!', '2007-12-02 23:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
