(4284091, 618386, 70181, '<td valign="top">Great timing on this shot.  The perspective makes it look like you''re gonna get overtaken by the wave as soon as you take the photo.  Great job.</td>', 'Great timing on this shot.  The perspective makes it look like you''re gonna get overtaken by the wave as soon as you take the photo.  Great job.', '2007-12-02 23:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
