(4284096, 615013, 22301, '<td valign="top">try this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial </a>if you have photoshop. It will help yo get the most out of your images before you upload. For example your image is 99 kb and the max allowance is 150 kb. that means your only using 2/3 the quality you could. It will help with the small details and make them a smooth transition.</td>', 'try this tutorial if you have photoshop. It will help yo get the most out of your images before you upload. For example your image is 99 kb and the max allowance is 150 kb. that means your only using 2/3 the quality you could. It will help with the small details and make them a smooth transition.', '2007-12-02 23:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284097, 618426, 70181, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually big on baby photos, but this one is excellent.  And the drool makes the shot cuter.  The white background was a good choice.  Very nice.  And my coworkers liked it too.  :)</td>', 'I''m not usually big on baby photos, but this one is excellent.  And the drool makes the shot cuter.  The white background was a good choice.  Very nice.  And my coworkers liked it too.  :)', '2007-12-02 23:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284099, 618336, 22301, '<td valign="top">try this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial </a>if you have photoshop. It will help yo get the most out of your images before you upload. For example your image is 36 kb and the max allowance is 150 kb. It will smooth out those drops and make your image smooth. Hope this helps, I like your DoF.</td>', 'try this tutorial if you have photoshop. It will help yo get the most out of your images before you upload. For example your image is 36 kb and the max allowance is 150 kb. It will smooth out those drops and make your image smooth. Hope this helps, I like your DoF.', '2007-12-02 23:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
