(4284658, 618397, 22301, '<td valign="top">A nice still life, but I think they can be hard to make really interesting. I am having trouble finding alot of interest for me in this photo. Maybe a different time of day would give a better throw of light and I could see more textures in the objects? I think a good still life has a lot of leading lines and hidden shapes through the objects, maybe try to work on those. It could also be that I am just not a still life kind of guy, so don''t read too much into it. :) 5</td>', 'A nice still life, but I think they can be hard to make really interesting. I am having trouble finding alot of interest for me in this photo. Maybe a different time of day would give a better throw of light and I could see more textures in the objects? I think a good still life has a lot of leading lines and hidden shapes through the objects, maybe try to work on those. It could also be that I am just not a still life kind of guy, so don''t read too much into it. :) 5', '2007-12-03 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
