(4284729, 612437, 22301, '<td valign="top">Its a beautiful sunset, but I think you lose a lot of detail due to image file size. your image is only 28 kb, but you can use up to 150 kb. This would make tiny details like the boat sharper as well even out the smooth areas like the clouds. Here is a <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial on DPC</a> that will help you get your entries up to their max limits as possible. Hope this helps some, Happy shooting.</td>', 'Its a beautiful sunset, but I think you lose a lot of detail due to image file size. your image is only 28 kb, but you can use up to 150 kb. This would make tiny details like the boat sharper as well even out the smooth areas like the clouds. Here is a tutorial on DPC that will help you get your entries up to their max limits as possible. Hope this helps some, Happy shooting.', '2007-12-03 03:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
