(4284755, 618026, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice find, its like its dredging out of the water to start its day. :)</td>', 'nice find, its like its dredging out of the water to start its day. :)', '2007-12-03 03:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284756, 617738, 22301, '<td valign="top">excellent, the tree really adds another positive dimension to this shot. lovely light as well.</td>', 'excellent, the tree really adds another positive dimension to this shot. lovely light as well.', '2007-12-03 03:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284757, 612564, 22301, '<td valign="top">great vision to see this, it really looks like a firework and makes me want to look at it some more, which for a flower shot and my own personal tastes say alot. :) An excellent FS image! 9</td>', 'great vision to see this, it really looks like a firework and makes me want to look at it some more, which for a flower shot and my own personal tastes say alot. :) An excellent FS image! 9', '2007-12-03 03:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284758, 618097, 22301, '<td valign="top">this is a serious macro, excellent detail and its like you got him to pose for you. well done 10</td>', 'this is a serious macro, excellent detail and its like you got him to pose for you. well done 10', '2007-12-03 03:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284761, 618329, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like this in color, just because I imagine they all have matching shirts and it would be interesting to see the refraction of light of the globe on the shirt of the girl in the center. the lighting is very nice and works well</td>', 'I think I would have like this in color, just because I imagine they all have matching shirts and it would be interesting to see the refraction of light of the globe on the shirt of the girl in the center. the lighting is very nice and works well', '2007-12-03 03:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284762, 616286, 22301, '<td valign="top">This looks beautiful, it just needs someone walking on that path in the foreground. all the colors look wonderful and I like the trunk of the trees. I think it would just be helped with a little human element. Just my opinion. :)</td>', 'This looks beautiful, it just needs someone walking on that path in the foreground. all the colors look wonderful and I like the trunk of the trees. I think it would just be helped with a little human element. Just my opinion. :)', '2007-12-03 03:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284763, 617846, 22301, '<td valign="top">th lighting is very nice on the deer, but some of the finer details look muddy, possibly from too much NI or post processing work. The composition is really good though,  I like how the background is split between the meadow and the cover of the woods.</td>', 'th lighting is very nice on the deer, but some of the finer details look muddy, possibly from too much NI or post processing work. The composition is really good though,  I like how the background is split between the meadow and the cover of the woods.', '2007-12-03 03:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284765, 618387, 22301, '<td valign="top">I really like that you got her expression, but for me I can''t see any details in his pants and he seems to just appear from his waist. its a tough shot, but I think you got the most important details with her face in tact. :)</td>', 'I really like that you got her expression, but for me I can''t see any details in his pants and he seems to just appear from his waist. its a tough shot, but I think you got the most important details with her face in tact. :)', '2007-12-03 03:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284771, 618581, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection and the snow on the ground which makes for a more difficult exposure. It appears o be over sharpened abit though, maybe add a gaussian blur and fade it back to get a nice soft focus dreamy feel. I really like how you framed the image, everything is laid out really nicely.</td>', 'I like the reflection and the snow on the ground which makes for a more difficult exposure. It appears o be over sharpened abit though, maybe add a gaussian blur and fade it back to get a nice soft focus dreamy feel. I really like how you framed the image, everything is laid out really nicely.', '2007-12-03 03:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284775, 615150, 22301, '<td valign="top">thats an excellent reflection! most I think say this shouldn''t be so centered but i think it works well. I wouldn''t change it, cool shot!</td>', 'thats an excellent reflection! most I think say this shouldn''t be so centered but i think it works well. I wouldn''t change it, cool shot!', '2007-12-03 03:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284777, 618278, 22301, '<td valign="top">the lighting looks to be done  well, but I think the focus needs a little work. It could just be the DoF though as the most centered leaf appears in focus.</td>', 'the lighting looks to be done  well, but I think the focus needs a little work. It could just be the DoF though as the most centered leaf appears in focus.', '2007-12-03 03:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284779, 610686, 22301, '<td valign="top">this is very cool composition, I like all the layers come together so concisely, foreground, cliff, clouded sky shic mimics the colors in the foreground and the blue sky to top it off. very nice indeed.</td>', 'this is very cool composition, I like all the layers come together so concisely, foreground, cliff, clouded sky shic mimics the colors in the foreground and the blue sky to top it off. very nice indeed.', '2007-12-03 03:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284781, 616672, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice catch on a rare clear day in SF! I like that you included the railing for perspective.</td>', 'nice catch on a rare clear day in SF! I like that you included the railing for perspective.', '2007-12-03 03:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284783, 618005, 22301, '<td valign="top">it seems so lifeless and cold, I think thats what you were going for, so I like it. :)</td>', 'it seems so lifeless and cold, I think thats what you were going for, so I like it. :)', '2007-12-03 03:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284788, 618373, 22301, '<td valign="top">Nice dragonfly macro, but you are losing a bunch of details because your file size is so small. It is only 65 kb and you can use up to 150 kb. This would make all the details in the little guy''s eyeballs really standout and I think it would help your score. if you use photoshop, here is a DPC <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> to help you get your images as large as they can be. :) Happy Shootin.</td>', 'Nice dragonfly macro, but you are losing a bunch of details because your file size is so small. It is only 65 kb and you can use up to 150 kb. This would make all the details in the little guy''s eyeballs really standout and I think it would help your score. if you use photoshop, here is a DPC tutorial to help you get your images as large as they can be. :) Happy Shootin.', '2007-12-03 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284789, 609613, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the color of that bird, :) seems to be a abit out of focus though. maybe try a deeper DoF so it doesn''t need to be as exact. I like how you got him eating too.</td>', 'I like the color of that bird, :) seems to be a abit out of focus though. maybe try a deeper DoF so it doesn''t need to be as exact. I like how you got him eating too.', '2007-12-03 04:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284790, 618435, 22301, '<td valign="top">thats a beauty of a sky. I would suggest getting closer to the poles if possible so they appear to be more part of the composition.</td>', 'thats a beauty of a sky. I would suggest getting closer to the poles if possible so they appear to be more part of the composition.', '2007-12-03 04:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284792, 612339, 22301, '<td valign="top">this has a very cool natural frame which makes the candles prominent, may have had even more pop without all the tourists, but that might be able to avoid. still I like all the colors. :) 8</td>', 'this has a very cool natural frame which makes the candles prominent, may have had even more pop without all the tourists, but that might be able to avoid. still I like all the colors. :) 8', '2007-12-03 04:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284793, 617548, 22301, '<td valign="top">cute kitty, I like his expression and the little bits of grass to help him show his size.</td>', 'cute kitty, I like his expression and the little bits of grass to help him show his size.', '2007-12-03 04:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284794, 618314, 22301, '<td valign="top">thats some cool water flow in the foreground, like a primordial soup. :)</td>', 'thats some cool water flow in the foreground, like a primordial soup. :)', '2007-12-03 04:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284795, 617443, 21991, '<td valign="top">looks like its underwater. nice effect</td>', 'looks like its underwater. nice effect', '2007-12-03 04:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284798, 609655, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and how the focus seems to be on both the flower and the spider. seems a little blurry though. Also try to get your file size as close to 150 kb as possible, your image is only 72 kb. If you are unsure how to do this and have photoshop, you may want to look at this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> on how to prepare your images for submission. I hate to see good images not get their fair vote because the image was too small a file size.</td>', 'I like the colors and how the focus seems to be on both the flower and the spider. seems a little blurry though. Also try to get your file size as close to 150 kb as possible, your image is only 72 kb. If you are unsure how to do this and have photoshop, you may want to look at this tutorial on how to prepare your images for submission. I hate to see good images not get their fair vote because the image was too small a file size.', '2007-12-03 04:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284800, 617706, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like how well this surfer stands out and how rough the surf is. well seen.</td>', 'I like how well this surfer stands out and how rough the surf is. well seen.', '2007-12-03 04:25:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4284802, 610081, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have been stronger if I could see more than just the sign. I think showing the doorway for example would have at least shown us what was playing and given more context.</td>', 'I think this image would have been stronger if I could see more than just the sign. I think showing the doorway for example would have at least shown us what was playing and given more context.', '2007-12-03 04:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284805, 618406, 22301, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and composition, I like the big smokestack just on the outskirts of downtown. It seems to show some character to the city besides just the sky line.</td>', 'Nice angle and composition, I like the big smokestack just on the outskirts of downtown. It seems to show some character to the city besides just the sky line.', '2007-12-03 04:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284807, 613445, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like all the repeating patterns, from the arches to the steps to the winfows on the wall.</td>', 'I like all the repeating patterns, from the arches to the steps to the winfows on the wall.', '2007-12-03 04:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284808, 617870, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the shutter speed used to capture the ocean break. I think the clouds lost a little too much detail from neat image. Maybe try duplicating the image and applying the NI to the top layer and using a mask so you can selectively have the NI work on the parts that need it the most. 8</td>', 'I like the shutter speed used to capture the ocean break. I think the clouds lost a little too much detail from neat image. Maybe try duplicating the image and applying the NI to the top layer and using a mask so you can selectively have the NI work on the parts that need it the most. 8', '2007-12-03 04:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284811, 609837, 22301, '<td valign="top">This composition feels l little bit awkward as the main components are so far away from each other. maybe posing her closer to the tree would have helped. The lightinf looks great, it looks like you used some sort of fill flash.</td>', 'This composition feels l little bit awkward as the main components are so far away from each other. maybe posing her closer to the tree would have helped. The lightinf looks great, it looks like you used some sort of fill flash.', '2007-12-03 04:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284812, 618119, 22301, '<td valign="top">love the black and white treatment and the clouds pop right off the page, it reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=6870" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dsidwell</a>''s black and white landscapes in Utah. beautiful tones 10</td>', 'love the black and white treatment and the clouds pop right off the page, it reminds me of  dsidwell''s black and white landscapes in Utah. beautiful tones 10', '2007-12-03 04:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284815, 618452, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop, it makes me connect with the animal. nice soft lighting makes it an intimate portrait.</td>', 'I like the tight crop, it makes me connect with the animal. nice soft lighting makes it an intimate portrait.', '2007-12-03 04:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284817, 616778, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like all the bokeh flying in front of and behind the bird. He seems to be straing at you while you took this. :)</td>', 'I like all the bokeh flying in front of and behind the bird. He seems to be straing at you while you took this. :)', '2007-12-03 04:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284818, 618523, 22301, '<td valign="top">this is a beauty of a landscape and reflection! I love the dark silhoutted land that just skims through the shot. top notch</td>', 'this is a beauty of a landscape and reflection! I love the dark silhoutted land that just skims through the shot. top notch', '2007-12-03 04:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284819, 618190, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice use of fill flash, but her arms appear a little too dark. Also I think getting closer and shooting from a lower angle would have made this shot more interesting, although I am sure the bride liked it. :)</td>', 'nice use of fill flash, but her arms appear a little too dark. Also I think getting closer and shooting from a lower angle would have made this shot more interesting, although I am sure the bride liked it. :)', '2007-12-03 04:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284831, 618292, 23478, '<td valign="top">wonderful portrait - I like the graininess here.</td>', 'wonderful portrait - I like the graininess here.', '2007-12-03 04:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284851, 615331, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers, awesome shot! Great framing. Nice light. Very cool processing. It works great. Well done!</td>', 'Wowsers, awesome shot! Great framing. Nice light. Very cool processing. It works great. Well done!', '2007-12-03 05:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284855, 616316, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great photography! Wonderful composition. Nice colors. Great timing, love the shadows. Nice job!</td>', 'Great photography! Wonderful composition. Nice colors. Great timing, love the shadows. Nice job!', '2007-12-03 05:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4284856, 612298, 19831, '<td valign="top">Incredible use of natural light! Great colors. Nice shot.</td>', 'Incredible use of natural light! Great colors. Nice shot.', '2007-12-03 05:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
