(4285018, 615452, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a super robin photo - so much detail in the feathers.  It is a shame thta he didn''t do you the favour of lighting on a more aestheically favourable stand! I love the close up, but would have liked just a tiny bit more room at the top. Despite my criticisms, a lovely photo that I would be very happy to receive as a Christmas card!</td>', 'What a super robin photo - so much detail in the feathers.  It is a shame thta he didn''t do you the favour of lighting on a more aestheically favourable stand! I love the close up, but would have liked just a tiny bit more room at the top. Despite my criticisms, a lovely photo that I would be very happy to receive as a Christmas card!', '2007-12-03 08:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285019, 617541, 87093, '<td valign="top">Good portrait</td>', 'Good portrait', '2007-12-03 08:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
