(4285032, 608400, 67258, '<td valign="top">The light on the horses is beautiful, but I do find myself distratced by the large expanse of blue sky.  Have you considered a panoramic style crop? The more I view the photo with the top masked off the more I like it!</td>', 'The light on the horses is beautiful, but I do find myself distratced by the large expanse of blue sky.  Have you considered a panoramic style crop? The more I view the photo with the top masked off the more I like it!', '2007-12-03 08:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285036, 618544, 87093, '<td valign="top">It is good</td>', 'It is good', '2007-12-03 08:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285060, 618431, 40386, '<td valign="top">I have had one of these guys hanging around here all summer, fascinating birds, unfortunately he has always been at the top of a very big fir tree in our garden so I havent been able to get close to him for this type of clarity, I have a few average shots of him perched flying up and flashing the white on his wings and know how quick they are and how hard to capture.  Awesome shot, good luck. 8</td>', 'I have had one of these guys hanging around here all summer, fascinating birds, unfortunately he has always been at the top of a very big fir tree in our garden so I havent been able to get close to him for this type of clarity, I have a few average shots of him perched flying up and flashing the white on his wings and know how quick they are and how hard to capture.  Awesome shot, good luck. 8', '2007-12-03 08:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285067, 618119, 40386, '<td valign="top">Lovely drama in this shot, great use of B&amp;W, coming back to comment and bumping to 8 Good luck</td>', 'Lovely drama in this shot, great use of B&W, coming back to comment and bumping to 8 Good luck', '2007-12-03 08:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
