(4285129, 618476, 67152, '<td valign="top">I really love the feel of this image - also, the composition is spot on - i just wish it were glowing a bit more - it is a little dark on my monitor and the colors while beautiful are a little too subdued to come across for the DPC audience - still, I will give it a 7 for quality of image and composition</td>', 'I really love the feel of this image - also, the composition is spot on - i just wish it were glowing a bit more - it is a little dark on my monitor and the colors while beautiful are a little too subdued to come across for the DPC audience - still, I will give it a 7 for quality of image and composition', '2007-12-03 09:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
