(4285442, 618585, 30982, '<td valign="top">As a female who likes animals often better than people and who wasn''t raised where this is an honored sport, I find this both terribly sad and impressive at the same time.  The bull''s face - it''s eyes - is so terribly pained.  Yet the grace and intensity of the bullfighter is quite exquisite.</td>', 'As a female who likes animals often better than people and who wasn''t raised where this is an honored sport, I find this both terribly sad and impressive at the same time.  The bull''s face - it''s eyes - is so terribly pained.  Yet the grace and intensity of the bullfighter is quite exquisite.', '2007-12-03 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
