(4285529, 615638, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2007-12-03 12:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285531, 617911, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, but the vignette needs a bit more opactity - right now it''s so dark that my eye goes to the vignette instead of the centre where the deer''s eyes are. Also, I think it needs a boost in contrast - it''s a bit muddy. One thing for all DP Challenges, since the size 640 pixels means you have to size down your image you''re going to lose sharpening. This alwys happens when you size down... If you''re using PHotoshop, the best tool is unsharp mask. However, any kind of overall sharpening would help a little. I''m finding the highlights in this need a bit of a boost as well.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, but the vignette needs a bit more opactity - right now it''s so dark that my eye goes to the vignette instead of the centre where the deer''s eyes are. Also, I think it needs a boost in contrast - it''s a bit muddy. One thing for all DP Challenges, since the size 640 pixels means you have to size down your image you''re going to lose sharpening. This alwys happens when you size down... If you''re using PHotoshop, the best tool is unsharp mask. However, any kind of overall sharpening would help a little. I''m finding the highlights in this need a bit of a boost as well.', '2007-12-03 12:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285532, 618251, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this angle.</td>', 'I like this angle.', '2007-12-03 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285535, 618196, 30982, '<td valign="top">Truly magical in monochrome - mesmerizing shot.</td>', 'Truly magical in monochrome - mesmerizing shot.', '2007-12-03 12:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285536, 618275, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the high keyishness to this.  Nicely framed, well composed.  Definitely has the feel of late summer to it, too.</td>', 'I like the high keyishness to this.  Nicely framed, well composed.  Definitely has the feel of late summer to it, too.', '2007-12-03 12:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285538, 609112, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks so very intent!  It''s quite endearing.</td>', 'She looks so very intent!  It''s quite endearing.', '2007-12-03 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285539, 618332, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great angle, great crop! Gotta love those oh so blue eyes!</td>', 'Great angle, great crop! Gotta love those oh so blue eyes!', '2007-12-03 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285541, 618344, 30982, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL portrait! I love shots like this that make me smile.  What an interesting face and an incredible, amazing smile!!</td>', 'WONDERFUL portrait! I love shots like this that make me smile.  What an interesting face and an incredible, amazing smile!!', '2007-12-03 12:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285542, 617658, 15207, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatley this is too blurry. I''d suggest using shutter priority instead of regular "P" or "A" - set shutter to a minimum of 125th sec with a moving object or higher. Turn up the ISO if needed and sacrifice grain for sharpness. Also, thre is not enough interst in the side of the dog or the tail... I''d suggest waiting to snap when the dog is facing the camera or only take a pcture from the side/tail view if something extremely interesting is going on back there. The best wildlife/nature/animal/human shots have the eyes as a main interest... again, unless something else is going on. If you want intentional blur, then practice a technique called panning. Slow your shutter and follow/track the animal with your lens so the animal almost appears in focus, while the background is out of focus/shows the blur.</td>', 'Unfortunatley this is too blurry. I''d suggest using shutter priority instead of regular "P" or "A" - set shutter to a minimum of 125th sec with a moving object or higher. Turn up the ISO if needed and sacrifice grain for sharpness. Also, thre is not enough interst in the side of the dog or the tail... I''d suggest waiting to snap when the dog is facing the camera or only take a pcture from the side/tail view if something extremely interesting is going on back there. The best wildlife/nature/animal/human shots have the eyes as a main interest... again, unless something else is going on. If you want intentional blur, then practice a technique called panning. Slow your shutter and follow/track the animal with your lens so the animal almost appears in focus, while the background is out of focus/shows the blur.', '2007-12-03 12:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285545, 618579, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well trained birds!  They''re in just the right place for you.</td>', 'Very well trained birds!  They''re in just the right place for you.', '2007-12-03 12:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285546, 618352, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on this alot.  She''s almost elf-like in a sweet, impish kinda way.  Great smile.</td>', 'I like the processing on this alot.  She''s almost elf-like in a sweet, impish kinda way.  Great smile.', '2007-12-03 12:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285548, 613108, 15207, '<td valign="top">The vignetting works... but I''d suggest lowering the opacity so you can still see some details around the corner. This image appears to lack contast, even though I can see clear highlights and shadows. I''m wondering if maybe it just needs a boost in sharpness... when you res down an image you''ll lose sharpenss (always happens).. the best tool is unsharp mask in Photoshop or any kind of sharpening tool you can find.</td>', 'The vignetting works... but I''d suggest lowering the opacity so you can still see some details around the corner. This image appears to lack contast, even though I can see clear highlights and shadows. I''m wondering if maybe it just needs a boost in sharpness... when you res down an image you''ll lose sharpenss (always happens).. the best tool is unsharp mask in Photoshop or any kind of sharpening tool you can find.', '2007-12-03 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285550, 618195, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has an intriguing starkness to it.  I like the "levels" - the green, then the white bark, then the orange leaves.</td>', 'Has an intriguing starkness to it.  I like the "levels" - the green, then the white bark, then the orange leaves.', '2007-12-03 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285553, 617970, 30982, '<td valign="top">The kind of shot I like to take - well seen, well captured, and I like the angle you took it from.  Very nice.</td>', 'The kind of shot I like to take - well seen, well captured, and I like the angle you took it from.  Very nice.', '2007-12-03 12:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285555, 611131, 30982, '<td valign="top">This may sound weird, but this makes me smile and feel all warm and fuzzy.  It''s delightfully colorful and busy.  And that one bit in the foreground just seems to be holding its own, and quite happily so.</td>', 'This may sound weird, but this makes me smile and feel all warm and fuzzy.  It''s delightfully colorful and busy.  And that one bit in the foreground just seems to be holding its own, and quite happily so.', '2007-12-03 12:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285558, 618248, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is priceless!  An excellent model.  Great set up and execution.</td>', 'This is priceless!  An excellent model.  Great set up and execution.', '2007-12-03 12:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285561, 613643, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The plane in the upper corner is..is... serendipitous?  Is that what I want?  That and the lamp.  And the hanging basket.  What a delightful shot to visit with!</td>', 'Great shot.  The plane in the upper corner is..is... serendipitous?  Is that what I want?  That and the lamp.  And the hanging basket.  What a delightful shot to visit with!', '2007-12-03 12:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285566, 617808, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really a warm glimpse of a couple of guys who''ve chosen in one way or another a lifestyle different from that most of us know.  Toning works well for this.</td>', 'Really a warm glimpse of a couple of guys who''ve chosen in one way or another a lifestyle different from that most of us know.  Toning works well for this.', '2007-12-03 12:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285568, 617538, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love this scene... and good job at putting something in the front to anchor the scene. ONe suggestion for future... try getting down at eye level with the waves or rocks/sand - because the person is further away the perspective will show that you are at eye leve with the human too. Right now it looks too much like hte camera is looking down at the scene.</td>', 'I love this scene... and good job at putting something in the front to anchor the scene. ONe suggestion for future... try getting down at eye level with the waves or rocks/sand - because the person is further away the perspective will show that you are at eye leve with the human too. Right now it looks too much like hte camera is looking down at the scene.', '2007-12-03 12:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285571, 617760, 30982, '<td valign="top">Eras in gold, no less.  excellent composition with wonderful light.</td>', 'Eras in gold, no less.  excellent composition with wonderful light.', '2007-12-03 12:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285740, 615836, 87097, '<td valign="top">I like the superposition of the real human in the scene. Feels a bit too much like a snapshot though. The reflections in the glass are distracting.</td>', 'I like the superposition of the real human in the scene. Feels a bit too much like a snapshot though. The reflections in the glass are distracting.', '2007-12-03 13:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285742, 615604, 87097, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, but this photo could use some better colors and sharpness.</td>', 'I really like the composition, but this photo could use some better colors and sharpness.', '2007-12-03 13:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
