(4286208, 618352, 68035, '<td valign="top">I am not normally a big fan of portraits in FS, but I have to say this works because it really engages the viewer (we are not looking at a model posing in a brightly lit studio) Love the muted colours the composition and the smile of the subject (which transcends simply looking at a camera and is instead looking at a person) 8 from me Lovely</td>', 'I am not normally a big fan of portraits in FS, but I have to say this works because it really engages the viewer (we are not looking at a model posing in a brightly lit studio) Love the muted colours the composition and the smile of the subject (which transcends simply looking at a camera and is instead looking at a person) 8 from me Lovely', '2007-12-03 16:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
