(4286218, 613351, 68035, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning animal portrait twith amazing quality and sharpness. There are so many animal shots in a free study that it takes something incredibly impressive to make you stop in your tracks and go wow.  This does is BIG time<br/> <br/>it makes me immediately think of some of SandyP''s work on the site.  If that is Sandy then all I can say is goodness you have done it again.  If it isnt Sandy then can I say the comparison should be taken as a huge compliment</td>', 'Absolutely stunning animal portrait twith amazing quality and sharpness. There are so many animal shots in a free study that it takes something incredibly impressive to make you stop in your tracks and go wow.  This does is BIG time it makes me immediately think of some of SandyP''s work on the site.  If that is Sandy then all I can say is goodness you have done it again.  If it isnt Sandy then can I say the comparison should be taken as a huge compliment', '2007-12-03 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4286240, 618486, 68956, '<td valign="top">A beautiful  cold, still capture, feels like I''m there:)</td>', 'A beautiful  cold, still capture, feels like I''m there:)', '2007-12-03 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
