(4286373, 615330, 83022, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the lens flare doesn''t help. I''m also not sure why the sun is shaped like it is, don''t think it helps. Beautiful vivid colors, nice compositon although not terribly original.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the lens flare doesn''t help. I''m also not sure why the sun is shaped like it is, don''t think it helps. Beautiful vivid colors, nice compositon although not terribly original.', '2007-12-03 17:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4286377, 617808, 83022, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting faces, surely one does say hope!  From a photogrpahic standopint, that white building in the background is distracting</td>', 'I like the contrasting faces, surely one does say hope!  From a photogrpahic standopint, that white building in the background is distracting', '2007-12-03 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4286381, 617849, 83022, '<td valign="top">excellenct compostiion I love abstract shapes out of everyday things. would have really been cool if you had captured some slight movement of the tram with a slower shutter speed. Wouldn''t be quite as static.</td>', 'excellenct compostiion I love abstract shapes out of everyday things. would have really been cool if you had captured some slight movement of the tram with a slower shutter speed. Wouldn''t be quite as static.', '2007-12-03 18:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4286385, 615113, 83022, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract out of flowing water. The big white blob at the top (where you lose detail) is always a problem when trying to show moving water, but I certainly like the bottom 2/3rds</td>', 'Interesting abstract out of flowing water. The big white blob at the top (where you lose detail) is always a problem when trying to show moving water, but I certainly like the bottom 2/3rds', '2007-12-03 18:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4286386, 614223, 49804, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice composition, could stand a bit more detail in the sky, but really neat shot still and an 8</td>', 'Great colors, nice composition, could stand a bit more detail in the sky, but really neat shot still and an 8', '2007-12-03 18:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
