(4287380, 608659, 68504, '<td valign="top">Geese, colour and framing all work beautifully.  (Not sure about the upper background which seems to be needlessly enhanced, because this seems fairly classic and should stand on its own).</td>', 'Geese, colour and framing all work beautifully.  (Not sure about the upper background which seems to be needlessly enhanced, because this seems fairly classic and should stand on its own).', '2007-12-04 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
