(4287607, 608659, 20608, '<td valign="top">nice duotone look, very hard to capture this and get it sharp, I have 3 swans shot from japan so i know how hard it is to nail it. good luck -8-</td>', 'nice duotone look, very hard to capture this and get it sharp, I have 3 swans shot from japan so i know how hard it is to nail it. good luck -8-', '2007-12-04 05:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287608, 611583, 20608, '<td valign="top">nice deer shot, i have one of these running too, yours has a nicer feel i think.</td>', 'nice deer shot, i have one of these running too, yours has a nicer feel i think.', '2007-12-04 05:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287627, 618334, 36606, '<td valign="top">very nice indeed. Magical 9</td>', 'very nice indeed. Magical 9', '2007-12-04 05:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287652, 615491, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the pose and the look on the models face.  The tonal range is superb, from white through to black.  For me there is something wrong about some of the edges - a slight shadowing - oversharpening perhaps?  Nonetheless, a beautifully presented nude.</td>', 'Love the pose and the look on the models face.  The tonal range is superb, from white through to black.  For me there is something wrong about some of the edges - a slight shadowing - oversharpening perhaps?  Nonetheless, a beautifully presented nude.', '2007-12-04 06:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287653, 618414, 67258, '<td valign="top">A bold image that I suspect would have good Stock potential.</td>', 'A bold image that I suspect would have good Stock potential.', '2007-12-04 06:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287655, 617779, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well composed landscape that leads the eye around and back into the picture.</td>', 'Well composed landscape that leads the eye around and back into the picture.', '2007-12-04 06:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287656, 617970, 67258, '<td valign="top">A really interesting photograph that I have thoroughly enjoyed exploring.  It is a bit of a shame thta the sweatshirt wearing figure is just visible behind the scales, but nonetheless a good documentary style photograph.</td>', 'A really interesting photograph that I have thoroughly enjoyed exploring.  It is a bit of a shame thta the sweatshirt wearing figure is just visible behind the scales, but nonetheless a good documentary style photograph.', '2007-12-04 06:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287658, 617577, 67258, '<td valign="top">What an interesting find, and I can quite see why you were drawn to photograph it.  The muted colours swirling into each other are amazing, and I find myself studying the picture to look for identifiable shapes, in much the same way as I look at flames in a fire.  There is a real sense of movement about the image, despitethe fact that it is of something entirely static.  For this particular photograph I do feel that you needed somewhat sharper focus - I suspect the light may have been such that you rellay needed the use of a tripod.</td>', 'What an interesting find, and I can quite see why you were drawn to photograph it.  The muted colours swirling into each other are amazing, and I find myself studying the picture to look for identifiable shapes, in much the same way as I look at flames in a fire.  There is a real sense of movement about the image, despitethe fact that it is of something entirely static.  For this particular photograph I do feel that you needed somewhat sharper focus - I suspect the light may have been such that you rellay needed the use of a tripod.', '2007-12-04 06:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287684, 610246, 68797, '<td valign="top">it looks like the Shire from LOTR! beautiful!</td>', 'it looks like the Shire from LOTR! beautiful!', '2007-12-04 07:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287705, 613320, 67258, '<td valign="top">The figure gazing into the distance in this almost surreal landscape works well and the minimalist like composition (unusual in landscapes)lends itself well to your title.  As a personal preference, though, I would prefer that the camera was not visible as it adds just a little clutter and thus diminishes the impact slightly.</td>', 'The figure gazing into the distance in this almost surreal landscape works well and the minimalist like composition (unusual in landscapes)lends itself well to your title.  As a personal preference, though, I would prefer that the camera was not visible as it adds just a little clutter and thus diminishes the impact slightly.', '2007-12-04 07:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287709, 615530, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the dark and gothic feel to this and the selective desat works well.  I do feel that the model looks a little self-consciously awkward, and I would have preferred a less centered composition - others may prefer it as it is.</td>', 'I like the dark and gothic feel to this and the selective desat works well.  I do feel that the model looks a little self-consciously awkward, and I would have preferred a less centered composition - others may prefer it as it is.', '2007-12-04 07:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287715, 618440, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot I''ve been trying to get a good shot of one of these in flight and have been unsuccessful. Very nice wing detail. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot I''ve been trying to get a good shot of one of these in flight and have been unsuccessful. Very nice wing detail. Good luck.', '2007-12-04 07:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287716, 618256, 67258, '<td valign="top">The lone tree with its winter bareness looks wonderful against the twilight blue sky.  I do wonder why you included quite so much foreground; for me it adds little to the composition.  Did you consider taking the photo from a more distant viewpoint? The inclusion of a little more sky at the top would give the tree a bit more space and prevent the composition feeling cramped.</td>', 'The lone tree with its winter bareness looks wonderful against the twilight blue sky.  I do wonder why you included quite so much foreground; for me it adds little to the composition.  Did you consider taking the photo from a more distant viewpoint? The inclusion of a little more sky at the top would give the tree a bit more space and prevent the composition feeling cramped.', '2007-12-04 07:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287717, 618285, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject with bags of potential for an entire series of photographs!  The border suits the photo well, drawing the eye in.  I suspect this was taken in harsh light, as the shadows are quite short but very dark - it might be interesting to retake at different times of the day, if thta is a possibility.  Compositionally, the sideways on truck  acts as something of a barrier - it may have been preferrable to take the photo with the truck at more of an angle, which would allow for the viewers eye to be led into the photo more.</td>', 'An interesting subject with bags of potential for an entire series of photographs!  The border suits the photo well, drawing the eye in.  I suspect this was taken in harsh light, as the shadows are quite short but very dark - it might be interesting to retake at different times of the day, if thta is a possibility.  Compositionally, the sideways on truck  acts as something of a barrier - it may have been preferrable to take the photo with the truck at more of an angle, which would allow for the viewers eye to be led into the photo more.', '2007-12-04 07:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287720, 618431, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super  photo  of a bird in its natural environment, with a background that allows the bird to stand out well.  It may be worth slightly subduing the bright spot behind the bird''s head.</td>', 'Super  photo  of a bird in its natural environment, with a background that allows the bird to stand out well.  It may be worth slightly subduing the bright spot behind the bird''s head.', '2007-12-04 08:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287721, 610081, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like a visit to the underworld!  The colours are good, and I like the tilted composition.</td>', 'Looks like a visit to the underworld!  The colours are good, and I like the tilted composition.', '2007-12-04 08:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287733, 615638, 36606, '<td valign="top">wow this is beautiful. Great light 9</td>', 'wow this is beautiful. Great light 9', '2007-12-04 08:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287737, 612298, 36606, '<td valign="top">beautiful. Great colours captured here. 8</td>', 'beautiful. Great colours captured here. 8', '2007-12-04 08:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287738, 618196, 36606, '<td valign="top">wow is this yanko? so clear and yet dreamlike 9</td>', 'wow is this yanko? so clear and yet dreamlike 9', '2007-12-04 08:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287739, 618542, 36606, '<td valign="top">stunning shot. Great reflection 8</td>', 'stunning shot. Great reflection 8', '2007-12-04 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287762, 618384, 73235, '<td valign="top">well balanced and lighted portrait.</td>', 'well balanced and lighted portrait.', '2007-12-04 08:25:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4287765, 615747, 73235, '<td valign="top">full of energy. good dual tone. did you try a tighter crop?</td>', 'full of energy. good dual tone. did you try a tighter crop?', '2007-12-04 08:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287768, 617846, 73235, '<td valign="top">good detail and composition</td>', 'good detail and composition', '2007-12-04 08:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287773, 612339, 73235, '<td valign="top">wow, this picture is busy. the idea with the burning candles in the foregound is cool. what I am missing is the focus on one single detail. what you show is so overwhelming, it''s hard to focus on one detail before drawn to something else.</td>', 'wow, this picture is busy. the idea with the burning candles in the foregound is cool. what I am missing is the focus on one single detail. what you show is so overwhelming, it''s hard to focus on one detail before drawn to something else.', '2007-12-04 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287788, 610686, 73235, '<td valign="top">good DOF, love the jig saw lines in the shrubs and then continued in the rocks.</td>', 'good DOF, love the jig saw lines in the shrubs and then continued in the rocks.', '2007-12-04 08:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287793, 618443, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the soft colors supporting the calmness of the picture</td>', 'I like the soft colors supporting the calmness of the picture', '2007-12-04 08:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287797, 617002, 8139, '<td valign="top">Lovely :-)</td>', 'Lovely :-)', '2007-12-04 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287798, 615669, 73235, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop coudl make the picture stronger , I think: leaving out a good part of the street and the shadows on the left. the way your pciture is composed you''re leading the viewer to the laft part of your shot.</td>', 'a tighter crop coudl make the picture stronger , I think: leaving out a good part of the street and the shadows on the left. the way your pciture is composed you''re leading the viewer to the laft part of your shot.', '2007-12-04 08:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287799, 616660, 73235, '<td valign="top">somehow it appears to me that you couldn''t make up your mind what you want to show - more of the sky or more of the beach. So you plced the horizon right n the middle.</td>', 'somehow it appears to me that you couldn''t make up your mind what you want to show - more of the sky or more of the beach. So you plced the horizon right n the middle.', '2007-12-04 08:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287801, 608400, 73235, '<td valign="top">beautiful morning picture. I love the contrast between the sun rizing on the left and the still shady spots on the right.</td>', 'beautiful morning picture. I love the contrast between the sun rizing on the left and the still shady spots on the right.', '2007-12-04 08:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287803, 618208, 73235, '<td valign="top">good composition, not overly exciting though.</td>', 'good composition, not overly exciting though.', '2007-12-04 08:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287804, 618529, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely aquas!  I like the composition alot - the fisherman versus the clouds with the sea between.</td>', 'Lovely aquas!  I like the composition alot - the fisherman versus the clouds with the sea between.', '2007-12-04 08:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287808, 618375, 73235, '<td valign="top">good composition, I like the use of the empty space to the left, where the tree is leaning towards.</td>', 'good composition, I like the use of the empty space to the left, where the tree is leaning towards.', '2007-12-04 08:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287809, 615725, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, both the photograph and the cat.  I love the sense of peace and restfulness.</td>', 'Beautiful, both the photograph and the cat.  I love the sense of peace and restfulness.', '2007-12-04 08:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287810, 618196, 69368, '<td valign="top">it''s just perfect! Like to see it in the Top 3! Good luck!</td>', 'it''s just perfect! Like to see it in the Top 3! Good luck!', '2007-12-04 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287813, 618169, 69368, '<td valign="top">wonderful scenery and fantastic colors.</td>', 'wonderful scenery and fantastic colors.', '2007-12-04 08:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287814, 617140, 73235, '<td valign="top">good silhoutte picture. just an idea: if you work the curves and saturation you could darken the upper part where the blue then could transition to almost black. may be this would add more drama?</td>', 'good silhoutte picture. just an idea: if you work the curves and saturation you could darken the upper part where the blue then could transition to almost black. may be this would add more drama?', '2007-12-04 08:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287816, 618382, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!  Love the grain and the grays!  Lovely nostalgic feel.</td>', 'Sweet!!  Love the grain and the grays!  Lovely nostalgic feel.', '2007-12-04 08:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287819, 618486, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful landscape/seascape! So romatical!</td>', 'beautiful landscape/seascape! So romatical!', '2007-12-04 08:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287820, 618336, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh! Great shot! Love the drop in play with the fantastic bokeh! Fantastic shallow DOF!</td>', 'oh! Great shot! Love the drop in play with the fantastic bokeh! Fantastic shallow DOF!', '2007-12-04 08:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287821, 618493, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - very nice lines from the clouds, light both direct and reflected, and composition.</td>', 'Excellent capture - very nice lines from the clouds, light both direct and reflected, and composition.', '2007-12-04 08:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287824, 617866, 73235, '<td valign="top">technically good executed. somehow I have the feeling it''s unbalanced. May be having the big guy embracing the little one in front of him and placing the big guy to the right could change that? But I like the idea of posing them like this.</td>', 'technically good executed. somehow I have the feeling it''s unbalanced. May be having the big guy embracing the little one in front of him and placing the big guy to the right could change that? But I like the idea of posing them like this.', '2007-12-04 08:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287825, 618572, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Well done.</td>', 'LOL!  Well done.', '2007-12-04 08:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287827, 617015, 8139, '<td valign="top">Photoframe 3? Nicely done .</td>', 'Photoframe 3? Nicely done .', '2007-12-04 08:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287828, 618380, 8139, '<td valign="top">Pixel art ?</td>', 'Pixel art ?', '2007-12-04 08:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287830, 618547, 73235, '<td valign="top">good arrangement, DOF and colors. relaxed expression on their faces.</td>', 'good arrangement, DOF and colors. relaxed expression on their faces.', '2007-12-04 08:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287833, 618454, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice soft light, intersting catch of the last beams hitting the tower.</td>', 'nice soft light, intersting catch of the last beams hitting the tower.', '2007-12-04 08:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287838, 617908, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Normally shots of toys/figurines aren''t received well but you did a GREAT job personifying this.  It''s a hoot!</td>', 'LOL!  Normally shots of toys/figurines aren''t received well but you did a GREAT job personifying this.  It''s a hoot!', '2007-12-04 08:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287839, 613164, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of your shutter speed. makes the water not too milky and keeps the impression of movement.</td>', 'I like the choice of your shutter speed. makes the water not too milky and keeps the impression of movement.', '2007-12-04 08:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287840, 616209, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great converging lines.</td>', 'Great converging lines.', '2007-12-04 08:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4287842, 613942, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I get a little tired of sunset/sunrise/beach shots, but this one is exceptionally nice - the color is nicely not overdone, it''s well composed, and I like the light alot.</td>', 'Sometimes I get a little tired of sunset/sunrise/beach shots, but this one is exceptionally nice - the color is nicely not overdone, it''s well composed, and I like the light alot.', '2007-12-04 08:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
