(4290887, 616316, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  The red of the brick work, perhaps reflecting late afternoon sun, in turn reflects the idea of fire itself.  shame you couldn''t persuade the owner of the building to remove the stacked boxes from the window, but even so well worthy of an 8 from me.</td>', 'I like this very much.  The red of the brick work, perhaps reflecting late afternoon sun, in turn reflects the idea of fire itself.  shame you couldn''t persuade the owner of the building to remove the stacked boxes from the window, but even so well worthy of an 8 from me.', '2007-12-05 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4290895, 614942, 67258, '<td valign="top">looks like you must have has this monkey (gibbon?) in your studio!  Stunning portrait revealing so much detail in such a hard to expose for subject.</td>', 'looks like you must have has this monkey (gibbon?) in your studio!  Stunning portrait revealing so much detail in such a hard to expose for subject.', '2007-12-05 07:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4290909, 618169, 67258, '<td valign="top">The Peak District?  The effect is almost illustration like, with the colours and landscape almost like idealised versions of reality.  I do like the photo very much, but I am not sure whether it is because of the effect, or despite it!</td>', 'The Peak District?  The effect is almost illustration like, with the colours and landscape almost like idealised versions of reality.  I do like the photo very much, but I am not sure whether it is because of the effect, or despite it!', '2007-12-05 07:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4290916, 617392, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a  back yard!  You certainly have captured a powerful sense of solitude.</td>', 'What a  back yard!  You certainly have captured a powerful sense of solitude.', '2007-12-05 07:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4290924, 618536, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like my kitchen sink!  Composition, exposure and processing are all strong.  I always enjoy looking at good quality photos of the everyday and mundane, and this fits the bill well.  Good work that could well form part of a larger project!</td>', 'Looks like my kitchen sink!  Composition, exposure and processing are all strong.  I always enjoy looking at good quality photos of the everyday and mundane, and this fits the bill well.  Good work that could well form part of a larger project!', '2007-12-05 07:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
