(4290953, 617455, 67258, '<td valign="top">With the exception of the white borders at top and bottom I really like this image.  The impressionistic effect of the reflections is quite amazing - the figure in the advert takes on a quite different feeling - almost balletic!  The contrast between actuality and the reflection is very clever, and certainly gives rise to thought. Compositionally, the saxophone player playing to the dancing girl in the ipod advert is effective, and the placement of all the components works well for me.  A strong photo.  back to bump to 10.</td>', 'With the exception of the white borders at top and bottom I really like this image.  The impressionistic effect of the reflections is quite amazing - the figure in the advert takes on a quite different feeling - almost balletic!  The contrast between actuality and the reflection is very clever, and certainly gives rise to thought. Compositionally, the saxophone player playing to the dancing girl in the ipod advert is effective, and the placement of all the components works well for me.  A strong photo.  back to bump to 10.', '2007-12-05 08:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
