(4291815, 618438, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp. I like the light in the foreground and the color and light on the rope complementing the city lights in the background. I wonder if this was an outtake for Complementary Colors.</td>', 'Nice and crisp. I like the light in the foreground and the color and light on the rope complementing the city lights in the background. I wonder if this was an outtake for Complementary Colors.', '2007-12-05 11:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
