(4291820, 618238, 23478, '<td valign="top">WOW - this all works together.  The balance of backlighting and front lighting, the curve of the arm matching the curve of the fabric.  Is that water spraying?  I love how it also has a purple hue.  There is a subtleness to her form created by the back lighting that makes the image more powerful.  Great job.  10.</td>', 'WOW - this all works together.  The balance of backlighting and front lighting, the curve of the arm matching the curve of the fabric.  Is that water spraying?  I love how it also has a purple hue.  There is a subtleness to her form created by the back lighting that makes the image more powerful.  Great job.  10.', '2007-12-05 11:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
