(4292012, 611356, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fun cake. Not such a good photo. He seems to be posing for the shot, so you should have had the opportunity to compose it better. What''s the point; is the girl part of the birthday present? Why is the second man in the photo? I think it would have been much more effective with just the two people, and with the girl out from behind the mans elbow.</td>', 'Fun cake. Not such a good photo. He seems to be posing for the shot, so you should have had the opportunity to compose it better. What''s the point; is the girl part of the birthday present? Why is the second man in the photo? I think it would have been much more effective with just the two people, and with the girl out from behind the mans elbow.', '2007-12-05 12:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
