(4292099, 618275, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think the frame overpowers the image, but I''m not voting on that. I would like to see the image adjusted for brightness with the yellow of the sunflowers  very luminous. If this were my image, I''d try manipulating Offset and Gamma in the Photoshop Exposure adjustments. I like the background a lot and the composition is nice.</td>', 'I think the frame overpowers the image, but I''m not voting on that. I would like to see the image adjusted for brightness with the yellow of the sunflowers  very luminous. If this were my image, I''d try manipulating Offset and Gamma in the Photoshop Exposure adjustments. I like the background a lot and the composition is nice.', '2007-12-05 12:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
