(4294178, 617757, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, good colors, good bokeh. It''s just not grabbing me. It may be the composition, but I can''t put my finger on it exactly.<br/> <br/>I looked at it some more and figured out what it is: My eye is being drawn in the wrong direction. My gaze is flowing up to the branch, rather than down to the apple. May just be me. I''m interested in seeing the other comments once this is over.</td>', 'Good lighting, good colors, good bokeh. It''s just not grabbing me. It may be the composition, but I can''t put my finger on it exactly. I looked at it some more and figured out what it is: My eye is being drawn in the wrong direction. My gaze is flowing up to the branch, rather than down to the apple. May just be me. I''m interested in seeing the other comments once this is over.', '2007-12-05 21:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
