(4296432, 618541, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but needs some work IMO:<br/> <br/>Focus is a bit off; perhaps just because this is a fairly severe crop? on the same note the noise in the BG is distracting to me (though sometimes I like a little of that, not sure why it bothers me here). <br/> <br/>Cherries are a touch pink rather than red on my monitor.<br/> <br/>Border doesn''t support the image (again, IMO). I''d rather see it pick up a highlight color (the grey of the stem, perhaps? or the slight blue-black from the BG on the left?) rather than reflecting what is the dominant color already.</td>', 'Nice idea, but needs some work IMO: Focus is a bit off; perhaps just because this is a fairly severe crop? on the same note the noise in the BG is distracting to me (though sometimes I like a little of that, not sure why it bothers me here).  Cherries are a touch pink rather than red on my monitor. Border doesn''t support the image (again, IMO). I''d rather see it pick up a highlight color (the grey of the stem, perhaps? or the slight blue-black from the BG on the left?) rather than reflecting what is the dominant color already.', '2007-12-06 15:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
