(4298287, 615452, 78062, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF on the post, but this could use a bit more ''pop'' in it i think. Also, the metal rail adds an interestinf juxtaposition to the concept as it has a soft fluffy creature associated with good will to all men and noel tidings etc, and the metal rail which is industrial.<br/> <br/>I don''t think that was deliberate, but it''s an interesting point all the same.</td>', 'I like the DOF on the post, but this could use a bit more ''pop'' in it i think. Also, the metal rail adds an interestinf juxtaposition to the concept as it has a soft fluffy creature associated with good will to all men and noel tidings etc, and the metal rail which is industrial. I don''t think that was deliberate, but it''s an interesting point all the same.', '2007-12-07 06:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298288, 611356, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice cake. the people look almost superimposed on the background though. did you guassian blur the background seperately? I say that because the level of blur seems constant the further into the background you go. If you did do that, a good way to make it look a bit more convincing is to do it on a seperate layer and mask bits out at differing opacities so the effect gets stronger as you go deeper into the field.<br/> <br/>Of course, i might be wasting my breath telling you this, but hey.</td>', 'Nice cake. the people look almost superimposed on the background though. did you guassian blur the background seperately? I say that because the level of blur seems constant the further into the background you go. If you did do that, a good way to make it look a bit more convincing is to do it on a seperate layer and mask bits out at differing opacities so the effect gets stronger as you go deeper into the field. Of course, i might be wasting my breath telling you this, but hey.', '2007-12-07 06:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298289, 618275, 78062, '<td valign="top">nice, but looks a bit flat in the yellow bits. Great DOF though.</td>', 'nice, but looks a bit flat in the yellow bits. Great DOF though.', '2007-12-07 06:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298290, 618426, 78062, '<td valign="top">Ha, nice. SHame you missed the top of the head though. Not sure about the toning either, the faded red doesn''t do a lot for me... maybe blue would have been more in keeping with traditional baby pics... but who wants tradition?</td>', 'Ha, nice. SHame you missed the top of the head though. Not sure about the toning either, the faded red doesn''t do a lot for me... maybe blue would have been more in keeping with traditional baby pics... but who wants tradition?', '2007-12-07 06:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298292, 615615, 78062, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I like the colours. It''s a shame the focus was missed and you didn''t get the monk doing something a bit more interesting. I also think if you zoomed in on the monks head as he was looking out the window, this would have ruled.</td>', 'Not bad. I like the colours. It''s a shame the focus was missed and you didn''t get the monk doing something a bit more interesting. I also think if you zoomed in on the monks head as he was looking out the window, this would have ruled.', '2007-12-07 06:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298293, 615013, 78062, '<td valign="top">nice pic but it''s a shame the b/w looks so flat. The skin is pretty much the same shade of grey which makes her look flat and 2d. some curves would have helped this, or even some dodge/burn to add some depth.</td>', 'nice pic but it''s a shame the b/w looks so flat. The skin is pretty much the same shade of grey which makes her look flat and 2d. some curves would have helped this, or even some dodge/burn to add some depth.', '2007-12-07 06:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298294, 618379, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice, but i think you cropped to close to the kid. If the camera was zoomed out a lot more it would amplify the feeling of helplessness and make the kid seem removed from his surroundings.</td>', 'Nice, but i think you cropped to close to the kid. If the camera was zoomed out a lot more it would amplify the feeling of helplessness and make the kid seem removed from his surroundings.', '2007-12-07 06:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
