(4298300, 617252, 78062, '<td valign="top">I think the halos kill this. And it seems a bit too dark in the foreground and what looks like some colour breakup. Composition isn''t bad, but if it was straightened it would probably hold more appeal. 5.</td>', 'I think the halos kill this. And it seems a bit too dark in the foreground and what looks like some colour breakup. Composition isn''t bad, but if it was straightened it would probably hold more appeal. 5.', '2007-12-07 06:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
