(4298398, 618030, 78062, '<td valign="top">nude, but wearing something... novel.<br/> <br/>nice colour of red but it almost looks like you cut her out and pasted on a white background- i say that because of the shadows around the arms. Still, i like it, and especially the contrast between the white and red. Nice lighting too.</td>', 'nude, but wearing something... novel. nice colour of red but it almost looks like you cut her out and pasted on a white background- i say that because of the shadows around the arms. Still, i like it, and especially the contrast between the white and red. Nice lighting too.', '2007-12-07 08:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
