(4299702, 613718, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful shapes and colors. I''d love to hear how you shot and processed this.</td>', 'beautiful shapes and colors. I''d love to hear how you shot and processed this.', '2007-12-07 17:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
