(4299720, 613700, 50695, '<td valign="top">Luscious old-fashioned sepia feeling here. I am reminded of a 19th century naturalist.</td>', 'Luscious old-fashioned sepia feeling here. I am reminded of a 19th century naturalist.', '2007-12-07 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
