(4299890, 617455, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks just like an ad - it''s very cool.  Great comparison with the sax player and then the ipod ad.  I''m also curious as to what is on the dark rectangle in the background as well.</td>', 'This looks just like an ad - it''s very cool.  Great comparison with the sax player and then the ipod ad.  I''m also curious as to what is on the dark rectangle in the background as well.', '2007-12-07 18:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
