(4299901, 617886, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail on the face.  I like it when the dog''s eye is the part in focus (I usually screw up and get the nose lol).  Too bad the poor baby has to wear a chain like that!</td>', 'Great lighting and detail on the face.  I like it when the dog''s eye is the part in focus (I usually screw up and get the nose lol).  Too bad the poor baby has to wear a chain like that!', '2007-12-07 18:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
