(4299917, 617095, 67697, '<td valign="top">hmmm looks like a Jayson dog who is no longer nameless :)  What really caught my attention is the eye.  The lighting on it looks great and makes it pop out of the picture.  I love the innocent peeking pose as well.</td>', 'hmmm looks like a Jayson dog who is no longer nameless :)  What really caught my attention is the eye.  The lighting on it looks great and makes it pop out of the picture.  I love the innocent peeking pose as well.', '2007-12-07 18:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
