(4299920, 608659, 67697, '<td valign="top">Canadian geese?  Love the reflections and the mist in the background.  Good job capturing an almost meditative moment.</td>', 'Canadian geese?  Love the reflections and the mist in the background.  Good job capturing an almost meditative moment.', '2007-12-07 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
