(4300287, 616588, 74534, '<td valign="top">After reviewing the play, the receiver was placed in an excellent diagonal line with the defender, and the composition is valid. The receiver makes a good football move, but gets somewhat lost in the busy background which the still-too-deep depth of field can not make go away. The ruling on the image stands, touchdown and 7 points.</td>', 'After reviewing the play, the receiver was placed in an excellent diagonal line with the defender, and the composition is valid. The receiver makes a good football move, but gets somewhat lost in the busy background which the still-too-deep depth of field can not make go away. The ruling on the image stands, touchdown and 7 points.', '2007-12-07 22:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300289, 616209, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and leading lines. Blown-out sky doesn''t bother much, but there seems to be a bit of purple fringing up there that could have been desaturated. Also, maybe a bit tighter crop, as with the DPC 640px limit the figure becomes really tiny.</td>', 'Very good composition and leading lines. Blown-out sky doesn''t bother much, but there seems to be a bit of purple fringing up there that could have been desaturated. Also, maybe a bit tighter crop, as with the DPC 640px limit the figure becomes really tiny.', '2007-12-07 22:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300290, 618423, 74534, '<td valign="top">I''ve been wanting to photograph long escalators for some time now, and you beat me to it... Good shot. How about one single person, somewhere down on of the escalators?</td>', 'I''ve been wanting to photograph long escalators for some time now, and you beat me to it... Good shot. How about one single person, somewhere down on of the escalators?', '2007-12-07 22:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300293, 612512, 74534, '<td valign="top">Only problem that the front of the head gets lost in the background highlight. I like the red and your title.</td>', 'Only problem that the front of the head gets lost in the background highlight. I like the red and your title.', '2007-12-07 22:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300294, 617802, 74534, '<td valign="top">With a person leaning against the rail looking into the distance, this would have been a 10 from me. Like this, it''s a very good image, excellent tones, good composition and good sky, but it draws me in to study it and then it feels... a bit empty. 8 from me.</td>', 'With a person leaning against the rail looking into the distance, this would have been a 10 from me. Like this, it''s a very good image, excellent tones, good composition and good sky, but it draws me in to study it and then it feels... a bit empty. 8 from me.', '2007-12-07 22:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300296, 615330, 74534, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and light. Very balanced with the sun vs. the tree. I wonder if you did some HDR or heavy levels adjustment to get back some detail in the side of the rock; if so you did a very good job of it.</td>', 'Excellent composition and light. Very balanced with the sun vs. the tree. I wonder if you did some HDR or heavy levels adjustment to get back some detail in the side of the rock; if so you did a very good job of it.', '2007-12-07 22:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300298, 617760, 28882, '<td valign="top">the colors in this are beautiful, also the shadows, there are so many great lines and shapes and depth.  nice shot.</td>', 'the colors in this are beautiful, also the shadows, there are so many great lines and shapes and depth.  nice shot.', '2007-12-07 22:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300301, 618544, 74534, '<td valign="top">I love how the water essentially becomes sky in the upper right corner. How about cloning out a couple of the markings on the boat? They make the pic look more "mundane".</td>', 'I love how the water essentially becomes sky in the upper right corner. How about cloning out a couple of the markings on the boat? They make the pic look more "mundane".', '2007-12-07 22:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300302, 618572, 74534, '<td valign="top">This is a very good image, but it feels a little bit contrived. Maybe it''s the white background that just says "studio" to me. In a "home" environment, but without loosing focus on the girl (yes, that''s hard, I know!) I think it would have been better.</td>', 'This is a very good image, but it feels a little bit contrived. Maybe it''s the white background that just says "studio" to me. In a "home" environment, but without loosing focus on the girl (yes, that''s hard, I know!) I think it would have been better.', '2007-12-07 22:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300308, 618466, 74534, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I''m biased by having seen similar shots from the likes of AlexSaberi... So only an 8 instead of a 10 from me. Actually, let''s make that a 9 for a very good duotone.</td>', 'Sorry, but I''m biased by having seen similar shots from the likes of AlexSaberi... So only an 8 instead of a 10 from me. Actually, let''s make that a 9 for a very good duotone.', '2007-12-07 22:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300310, 618334, 74534, '<td valign="top">Great composition, with the center rock hiding the brightest part of the sky. You took one of the biggest problems of very long night exposures and turned it around to your advantage.</td>', 'Great composition, with the center rock hiding the brightest part of the sky. You took one of the biggest problems of very long night exposures and turned it around to your advantage.', '2007-12-07 22:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300320, 618035, 74534, '<td valign="top">I love how she''s looking in a different direction, even though he is looking at her. Perfect composition, lighting and poses. But mostly this image speaks to me of time, people, how we spend our lives and how others are an integral part of it... very "deep" image... 10 from me, as well as my pick for blue.</td>', 'I love how she''s looking in a different direction, even though he is looking at her. Perfect composition, lighting and poses. But mostly this image speaks to me of time, people, how we spend our lives and how others are an integral part of it... very "deep" image... 10 from me, as well as my pick for blue.', '2007-12-07 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300323, 618212, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful - tremendous composition and tones. <br/> <br/>Coming back for a second comment... the mist, the tones, the silhouettes, everything about this image seems to work perfectly together. 10 from me, as well as my pick for red ribbon...</td>', 'Very beautiful - tremendous composition and tones.  Coming back for a second comment... the mist, the tones, the silhouettes, everything about this image seems to work perfectly together. 10 from me, as well as my pick for red ribbon...', '2007-12-07 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300325, 618187, 74534, '<td valign="top">A perfect portrait... The pose, the expression, the lighting, all combine to make you want to know more about this special person. I like the duotone as well, and even the skin texture adds to the image. 10 from me and my pick for yellow ribbon.</td>', 'A perfect portrait... The pose, the expression, the lighting, all combine to make you want to know more about this special person. I like the duotone as well, and even the skin texture adds to the image. 10 from me and my pick for yellow ribbon.', '2007-12-07 22:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300329, 613237, 74534, '<td valign="top">A moment in time... only happened once and it''s never coming back. It''s not the pose that makes it seem that way to me... it''s the shadow. It''s like everything, including the sun, has conspired to make this moment exist. And you captured it. 10 from me.</td>', 'A moment in time... only happened once and it''s never coming back. It''s not the pose that makes it seem that way to me... it''s the shadow. It''s like everything, including the sun, has conspired to make this moment exist. And you captured it. 10 from me.', '2007-12-07 22:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4300350, 618486, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and zen like. Love the colors.</td>', 'Very pretty and zen like. Love the colors.', '2007-12-07 22:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
