(4300682, 616134, 3724, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit to like in this....... has some qualities of a formal decorative abstraction.<br/>Interesting colour, odd shapes, and cross composition I think are actually striking. It is a unusual edit, and has a bit of a subdued rustic quality -  which I try to ignore.</td>', 'Quite a bit to like in this....... has some qualities of a formal decorative abstraction.Interesting colour, odd shapes, and cross composition I think are actually striking. It is a unusual edit, and has a bit of a subdued rustic quality -  which I try to ignore.', '2007-12-08 00:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
