(4300685, 617002, 30982, '<td valign="top">Thank you for this.  I so enjoyed coming upon it in the challenge, that I revisited it often.  Remarkable.  I would suspect that you did stage this with respect to the foreground couple, but have to believe that the couple in the distance was serendipitous, and marvelously so.  Regardless, it is indeed a masterful piece of work.  Edit to say thanks to Ed for putting into words what I could not.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-08 01:59:50.</i></td>', 'Thank you for this.  I so enjoyed coming upon it in the challenge, that I revisited it often.  Remarkable.  I would suspect that you did stage this with respect to the foreground couple, but have to believe that the couple in the distance was serendipitous, and marvelously so.  Regardless, it is indeed a masterful piece of work.  Edit to say thanks to Ed for putting into words what I could not.', '2007-12-08 00:41:50.000000', '2007-12-08 01:59:50.000000', 0),
