(4300701, 617738, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is really just an amazing shot. I cannot believe it didn''t finish higher. Honestly a top 10 shot IMO. Great composition and just the right saturation. Congrats on an incredible capture.</td>', 'This is really just an amazing shot. I cannot believe it didn''t finish higher. Honestly a top 10 shot IMO. Great composition and just the right saturation. Congrats on an incredible capture.', '2007-12-08 00:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4300703, 617002, 200, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AP:</b></div><hr/><i> this is a lovely shot that is rife interpretive potential.  I''d be curious to know whether it is staged? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is staged in the sense that I had the couple stand at this spot during their engagement session. Some things cant be staged. I had no idea the older couple was walking hand in hand in the background until I started editing. Are their emotions during this moment staged? I did not instruct them to appreciate each other, to be in love, to close their eyes, to hug or for him to place his head on hers. Life happens and I snap the shutter anyway.</td>', 'Originally posted by AP: this is a lovely shot that is rife interpretive potential.  I''d be curious to know whether it is staged?   It is staged in the sense that I had the couple stand at this spot during their engagement session. Some things cant be staged. I had no idea the older couple was walking hand in hand in the background until I started editing. Are their emotions during this moment staged? I did not instruct them to appreciate each other, to be in love, to close their eyes, to hug or for him to place his head on hers. Life happens and I snap the shutter anyway.', '2007-12-08 00:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
