(4300713, 618192, 60862, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha! I was one of the dummies who voted this a 9. You have a unique way at looking at things. I wish more valued that. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, I was one of the dummies who voted this a 4.  Just didn''t spend enough time with it, and for that, I apologize.  What a contrast between nature''s chaos and sometimes lack of obvious beauty vs. the sterile artificiality of our constructions like golf courses.  There''s no question I''d prefer to spend time turning over rocks and walking in the woods than playing golf.</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Ha! I was one of the dummies who voted this a 9. You have a unique way at looking at things. I wish more valued that.   Well, I was one of the dummies who voted this a 4.  Just didn''t spend enough time with it, and for that, I apologize.  What a contrast between nature''s chaos and sometimes lack of obvious beauty vs. the sterile artificiality of our constructions like golf courses.  There''s no question I''d prefer to spend time turning over rocks and walking in the woods than playing golf.', '2007-12-08 00:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
