(4301020, 617443, 70661, '<td valign="top">WOW! Awesome shot! Congrats Deb!!</td>', 'WOW! Awesome shot! Congrats Deb!!', '2007-12-08 06:44:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301025, 617812, 48228, '<td valign="top">I lust love the softness of this one Roz and what a loving composition of mother and calf..... I do believe this deserved a higher score than this, but therr were some excellent entries in this months best of challenge.</td>', 'I lust love the softness of this one Roz and what a loving composition of mother and calf..... I do believe this deserved a higher score than this, but therr were some excellent entries in this months best of challenge.', '2007-12-08 06:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301027, 618334, 70661, '<td valign="top">Very, very beautiful! Congrats!</td>', 'Very, very beautiful! Congrats!', '2007-12-08 06:47:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301030, 618317, 70661, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot Cory!</td>', 'Beautiful shot Cory!', '2007-12-08 06:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301031, 617443, 37961, '<td valign="top">You hit the jackpot with this one. Love the gradient of colors &amp; textures. Fabulous.</td>', 'You hit the jackpot with this one. Love the gradient of colors & textures. Fabulous.', '2007-12-08 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301032, 618196, 37961, '<td valign="top">Stunning. What no evil deer today? LOL</td>', 'Stunning. What no evil deer today? LOL', '2007-12-08 06:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301046, 618317, 37961, '<td valign="top">I suspect this could have scored higher had there been a looser crop, but if that wasn''t possible perhaps some light on the building front. Still a pretty shot. Makes you pause and think.</td>', 'I suspect this could have scored higher had there been a looser crop, but if that wasn''t possible perhaps some light on the building front. Still a pretty shot. Makes you pause and think.', '2007-12-08 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301049, 618352, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh.  Please ignore the score completely.  I love this shot.  I gave you an 8.  This is simply excellent.</td>', 'Oh my gosh.  Please ignore the score completely.  I love this shot.  I gave you an 8.  This is simply excellent.', '2007-12-08 07:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301050, 617708, 7786, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors and the smooth ocean. I wonder why it didn''t score higher. I deserves so.</td>', 'Fantastic colors and the smooth ocean. I wonder why it didn''t score higher. I deserves so.', '2007-12-08 07:08:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301054, 618083, 67152, '<td valign="top">Shannon - I just cound decide if it was you, Nick, or Steve that took this...<br/> <br/>Excellent stuff - I love the stillness of the water, the lights of Mystic behind, and the various blue tones.  I think the only thing I see as a "DPC" issue is the apparent grain in the sky.  I think it works really well in the image, but others probably see it as a flaw.</td>', 'Shannon - I just cound decide if it was you, Nick, or Steve that took this... Excellent stuff - I love the stillness of the water, the lights of Mystic behind, and the various blue tones.  I think the only thing I see as a "DPC" issue is the apparent grain in the sky.  I think it works really well in the image, but others probably see it as a flaw.', '2007-12-08 07:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301061, 618083, 7786, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice. The composition and reflection are great but suffers from noise. Getting sharp details, like the mast ropes, in those iso 800 shots is difficult. I think a sturdy tripod and longer exposure on lower iso would have made a big difference.</td>', 'Pretty nice. The composition and reflection are great but suffers from noise. Getting sharp details, like the mast ropes, in those iso 800 shots is difficult. I think a sturdy tripod and longer exposure on lower iso would have made a big difference.', '2007-12-08 07:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301063, 618380, 48471, '<td valign="top">I can understand 1s and 10s, well, with a strech 2s and 3s also (maybe beacuse of the fancy border?), but for the life of me, I can''t understand 4s, 5s, 6s, and 7s. Gotta love this place, Earthlings are funny species, but among them artists are the best. It''s not a waste of time, it''s a spark on spending a life on seducing Pschye...</td>', 'I can understand 1s and 10s, well, with a strech 2s and 3s also (maybe beacuse of the fancy border?), but for the life of me, I can''t understand 4s, 5s, 6s, and 7s. Gotta love this place, Earthlings are funny species, but among them artists are the best. It''s not a waste of time, it''s a spark on spending a life on seducing Pschye...', '2007-12-08 07:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301068, 618238, 23478, '<td valign="top">great job, one of my favorite in this FS.</td>', 'great job, one of my favorite in this FS.', '2007-12-08 07:17:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301069, 618334, 67152, '<td valign="top">Þorsteinn - Fantastic stuff!  I love the shapes and feel that this image brings...the clouds seem to mirror the rocks below and the softness of the water makes it seem as if it is smoke...A great Blue!</td>', 'Þorsteinn - Fantastic stuff!  I love the shapes and feel that this image brings...the clouds seem to mirror the rocks below and the softness of the water makes it seem as if it is smoke...A great Blue!', '2007-12-08 07:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301081, 611583, 67152, '<td valign="top">Fabulous image.  What a treat for everyone at DPC to see this all week.  I just feel bad for the five poor souls that don''t have a clue about photography (giving you a 3 or less)  Congrats on the Yellow!</td>', 'Fabulous image.  What a treat for everyone at DPC to see this all week.  I just feel bad for the five poor souls that don''t have a clue about photography (giving you a 3 or less)  Congrats on the Yellow!', '2007-12-08 07:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301083, 618547, 23478, '<td valign="top">congrats on a strong entry!  Great to see it finishing so high and scoring well.  A beautiful portrait.</td>', 'congrats on a strong entry!  Great to see it finishing so high and scoring well.  A beautiful portrait.', '2007-12-08 07:24:24.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4301085, 615669, 48471, '<td valign="top">I don''t know... I wish, I really wish I did know, but I just don''t...</td>', 'I don''t know... I wish, I really wish I did know, but I just don''t...', '2007-12-08 07:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301086, 617847, 54228, '<td valign="top">Too underated, this is amazing! Great work!</td>', 'Too underated, this is amazing! Great work!', '2007-12-08 07:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301091, 618192, 55838, '<td valign="top">HA!  I voted this an 8 and I contend that I am not a dummie (I conceed that Yanko is one though! :)  5.1!!!!!!!!!  You were completely R-O-B-B-E-D on this shot.  Well done and keep shooting cool interesting stuff that tells stories.  Of course if you want a slam dunk high score then perhaps you should shoot something really fascinating like...wine glasses...or a deer head.  : )<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-08 07:31:13.</i></td>', 'HA!  I voted this an 8 and I contend that I am not a dummie (I conceed that Yanko is one though! :)  5.1!!!!!!!!!  You were completely R-O-B-B-E-D on this shot.  Well done and keep shooting cool interesting stuff that tells stories.  Of course if you want a slam dunk high score then perhaps you should shoot something really fascinating like...wine glasses...or a deer head.  : )', '2007-12-08 07:29:02.000000', '2007-12-08 07:31:13.000000', 0),
(4301092, 617754, 48471, '<td valign="top">The eye... is point...</td>', 'The eye... is point...', '2007-12-08 07:29:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301094, 617754, 67152, '<td valign="top">I can not for the life of me understand the DPC crowd sometimes.  This is an amazing image, so much sketch as much as photograph.  I think I underrated the image during voting myself. I only gave it an 8</td>', 'I can not for the life of me understand the DPC crowd sometimes.  This is an amazing image, so much sketch as much as photograph.  I think I underrated the image during voting myself. I only gave it an 8', '2007-12-08 07:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301095, 618192, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m one of the other dummies along with Yanko.  Geesh, you''d think we''d get a clue, don''t you?  This is magnificent on so many levels.  Thanks for taking it and sharing it with at least a few of us.  :-)</td>', 'I''m one of the other dummies along with Yanko.  Geesh, you''d think we''d get a clue, don''t you?  This is magnificent on so many levels.  Thanks for taking it and sharing it with at least a few of us.  :-)', '2007-12-08 07:30:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301096, 613643, 23478, '<td valign="top">wonderful image and I am surprised to find it did not do better!  Congrats on a wonderful image.</td>', 'wonderful image and I am surprised to find it did not do better!  Congrats on a wonderful image.', '2007-12-08 07:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301104, 610462, 23478, '<td valign="top">Well, this is another one that should have score higher (IMO), but a wonderful keeper, in any case!</td>', 'Well, this is another one that should have score higher (IMO), but a wonderful keeper, in any case!', '2007-12-08 07:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301109, 618334, 51269, '<td valign="top">Congratulations--magical image !</td>', 'Congratulations--magical image !', '2007-12-08 07:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301111, 618476, 67152, '<td valign="top">Michele - Excellent stuff!   Great finish on this image.  I am glad that DPC rewarded you!</td>', 'Michele - Excellent stuff!   Great finish on this image.  I am glad that DPC rewarded you!', '2007-12-08 07:39:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301117, 617443, 51269, '<td valign="top">WHoo Hoo , Deb !!! I had a feeling this was yours cause of those gorgeous mountains---amazing shot &amp; well deserved ten spot (should be higher IMO)-congrats &amp; big hug :) -P</td>', 'WHoo Hoo , Deb !!! I had a feeling this was yours cause of those gorgeous mountains---amazing shot & well deserved ten spot (should be higher IMO)-congrats & big hug :) -P', '2007-12-08 07:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301120, 616316, 67152, '<td valign="top">Steve<br/>Excellent image - Congrats!  You broke the 6 barrier...I will be expecting many more 6+ images in the future.  You have a good eye and your technique and image quality keeps jumping.</td>', 'SteveExcellent image - Congrats!  You broke the 6 barrier...I will be expecting many more 6+ images in the future.  You have a good eye and your technique and image quality keeps jumping.', '2007-12-08 07:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301127, 615638, 67152, '<td valign="top">Peter - Fabulous work here. Congrats on the Red.  The blowing snow, the shadows on the snow drifts, and the pines in the back all work so magically together.  <br/> <br/>As I see from other photos of that same day, you had a pretty good light day.  I think it is one we photographers all dream of.  Now...If we can just figure out when these are going to happen in advance!</td>', 'Peter - Fabulous work here. Congrats on the Red.  The blowing snow, the shadows on the snow drifts, and the pines in the back all work so magically together.   As I see from other photos of that same day, you had a pretty good light day.  I think it is one we photographers all dream of.  Now...If we can just figure out when these are going to happen in advance!', '2007-12-08 07:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301128, 618197, 51269, '<td valign="top">well now, Jeffrey, this is not too shabby!<br/>Seriously, big congrats on high placement- your set-up &amp; execution (ooo creepy word) are perfect ! :)</td>', 'well now, Jeffrey, this is not too shabby!Seriously, big congrats on high placement- your set-up & execution (ooo creepy word) are perfect ! :)', '2007-12-08 07:47:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301130, 618547, 51269, '<td valign="top">Congratulations , Ken- this was a stand out in the challenge....lucky grandparents !</td>', 'Congratulations , Ken- this was a stand out in the challenge....lucky grandparents !', '2007-12-08 07:50:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301132, 618197, 67152, '<td valign="top">Gelatin appears to be a good thing here at DPC!  I will need to remember this.<br/> <br/>Nice work and great finish Jeff.  The lighting is really good, the composition is interesting, and the graphic feel really draws the viewer in with that "Wow" effect.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Gelatin appears to be a good thing here at DPC!  I will need to remember this. Nice work and great finish Jeff.  The lighting is really good, the composition is interesting, and the graphic feel really draws the viewer in with that "Wow" effect.   ', '2007-12-08 07:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301133, 613351, 51269, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Doug, this was a big fave of mine in the challenge :)</td>', 'Congratulations, Doug, this was a big fave of mine in the challenge :)', '2007-12-08 07:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301137, 612564, 51269, '<td valign="top">WOWZA, Jeannie ---congratulations on a brilliant image and personal best for you ! Very proud of you :) P</td>', 'WOWZA, Jeannie ---congratulations on a brilliant image and personal best for you ! Very proud of you :) P', '2007-12-08 07:56:59.000000', NULL, 0),
