(4301186, 617443, 66494, '<td valign="top">WOW Deb, this is truly outstanding. You got a little ol TEN 10 X from me on this beauty. I''m so glad you''ve been able to adjust to the hot country and flourish photographically. It sure has been a good experience for us in the DPC community. THANK YOU.</td>', 'WOW Deb, this is truly outstanding. You got a little ol TEN 10 X from me on this beauty. I''m so glad you''ve been able to adjust to the hot country and flourish photographically. It sure has been a good experience for us in the DPC community. THANK YOU.', '2007-12-08 08:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
