(4301418, 618005, 35357, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote, but I would''ve scored this very high, I really like the contrastiness, lighting, and unusual subject.  Interesting!  I think this has quite an artistic look.  It''s funny that this shot managed to piss one person off enough to give you a 1, haha!<br/> <br/>Anyway, it just goes to show how some voters are hung up on subject matter over quality and a truly (to me) interesting shot, which could be hanging in a gallery.  There are a good number of 7+ scores, though, so there are some voters with good taste.  I''ll go out on a limb and say that anybody who scored this shot 5 or under is an asshole.<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/>:-)</td>', 'I didn''t vote, but I would''ve scored this very high, I really like the contrastiness, lighting, and unusual subject.  Interesting!  I think this has quite an artistic look.  It''s funny that this shot managed to piss one person off enough to give you a 1, haha! Anyway, it just goes to show how some voters are hung up on subject matter over quality and a truly (to me) interesting shot, which could be hanging in a gallery.  There are a good number of 7+ scores, though, so there are some voters with good taste.  I''ll go out on a limb and say that anybody who scored this shot 5 or under is an asshole. Cheers!:-)', '2007-12-08 11:09:46.000000', NULL, 0),
