(4301900, 617812, 66494, '<td valign="top">Gee Roz, you got a nice ol 9 from me. Love the warm happy feel. AND most of all love the pp here. Wow.</td>', 'Gee Roz, you got a nice ol 9 from me. Love the warm happy feel. AND most of all love the pp here. Wow.', '2007-12-08 16:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301904, 616479, 66494, '<td valign="top">Your composition here is really really nice. Love the angle. The eyes of the female model look a bit blank. But all in all I think this is a great portrait shot.</td>', 'Your composition here is really really nice. Love the angle. The eyes of the female model look a bit blank. But all in all I think this is a great portrait shot.', '2007-12-08 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301914, 617443, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top ten! Was this shot through a window or was it a clear shot? I took something similar from a commercial plane over the Rockies and had a similar color effect, although it was stronger in the orignal so I assumed it was just the glass causing it.</td>', 'Congrats on the top ten! Was this shot through a window or was it a clear shot? I took something similar from a commercial plane over the Rockies and had a similar color effect, although it was stronger in the orignal so I assumed it was just the glass causing it.', '2007-12-08 16:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301917, 616961, 66494, '<td valign="top">Oh Anni, you like the same things I do!  I''ve always had a thing for the bales of hay and the pretty fields behind them. Nice shot.</td>', 'Oh Anni, you like the same things I do!  I''ve always had a thing for the bales of hay and the pretty fields behind them. Nice shot.', '2007-12-08 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 0),
