(4301924, 618443, 66494, '<td valign="top">You know, Alan, I think this should have placed a lot higher. I really like the composition. <br/>Oh ... and thank you so very much for the great comments on my shot. <br/>Back to your shot ... the angle really lifts this shot to a whole new level.</td>', 'You know, Alan, I think this should have placed a lot higher. I really like the composition. Oh ... and thank you so very much for the great comments on my shot. Back to your shot ... the angle really lifts this shot to a whole new level.', '2007-12-08 17:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
