(4302939, 617050, 30982, '<td valign="top">The scale of the pipe thing is befuddling - which is cool.  Processing brings something to this - like you note, it became more than what it was.</td>', 'The scale of the pipe thing is befuddling - which is cool.  Processing brings something to this - like you note, it became more than what it was.', '2007-12-09 08:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4302986, 617658, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ve no problems with the blur - I like the blur!  I do think it''s a little dark - a bit of levels adjustment maybe?  (Or don''t view it on my work monitor, maybe?)  A fun shot, though.  Now see if you can shoot him running towards you, just for fun!</td>', 'I''ve no problems with the blur - I like the blur!  I do think it''s a little dark - a bit of levels adjustment maybe?  (Or don''t view it on my work monitor, maybe?)  A fun shot, though.  Now see if you can shoot him running towards you, just for fun!', '2007-12-09 08:58:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4302990, 618212, 30982, '<td valign="top">A masterfully crafted image - very polished, very serene.  But your "Alone" image totally kicks butt in comparison.  :-)</td>', 'A masterfully crafted image - very polished, very serene.  But your "Alone" image totally kicks butt in comparison.  :-)', '2007-12-09 09:01:05.000000', NULL, 0),
