(4303359, 618585, 61559, '<td valign="top">REALLY awesome shot! The animal lovers who are upset about this shot are missing something. The bull is a pretty sympathetic chararcter in this shot.The young bullfighter''s face is captured in great detail and his expression is so over the top, he serves as a parody for the masochistic tradition he represents.<br/> <br/>Photojournalism doesn''t get any better than this.<br/> <br/>Very, very, VERY well done!</td>', 'REALLY awesome shot! The animal lovers who are upset about this shot are missing something. The bull is a pretty sympathetic chararcter in this shot.The young bullfighter''s face is captured in great detail and his expression is so over the top, he serves as a parody for the masochistic tradition he represents. Photojournalism doesn''t get any better than this. Very, very, VERY well done!', '2007-12-09 11:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303377, 617015, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rhipster:</b></div><hr/><i> Photoframe 3? Nicely done . </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hahahahahaha yes that''s right</td>', 'Originally posted by rhipster: Photoframe 3? Nicely done .   Hahahahahaha yes that''s right', '2007-12-09 12:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303422, 612843, 65319, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Gave you an 8.  I can never quite explain why I like your work, but I seem to always like it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My own explanation is the you are exceptionally GIFTED at making a powerful statement out of...The Understatement.  (Please feel free to explain exactly the mystery of HOW DO YOU DO THAT?!!!...Inquiring minds want to know...;-)...)</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Gave you an 8.  I can never quite explain why I like your work, but I seem to always like it.   My own explanation is the you are exceptionally GIFTED at making a powerful statement out of...The Understatement.  (Please feel free to explain exactly the mystery of HOW DO YOU DO THAT?!!!...Inquiring minds want to know...;-)...)', '2007-12-09 12:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303448, 617740, 76198, '<td valign="top">I was going to say something about how this picture''s placement doesn''t reflect its quality. <br/> <br/>Then I checked out your portfolio and realized that you know that. So I''ll just say that I love it and leave it at that.</td>', 'I was going to say something about how this picture''s placement doesn''t reflect its quality.  Then I checked out your portfolio and realized that you know that. So I''ll just say that I love it and leave it at that.', '2007-12-09 12:47:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303468, 618454, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the job, but enjoy the hiatus.  What comes next is an adventure - always is!  I like the shot because it''s real - not overdone, not oversaturated.  And don''t not do flowers unless you don''t want to, because you have a rare gift for portraying emotion with flowers - lots of people try, but for some reason, you pull it off better than anyone.  You could skip the net shots, though.  :-)</td>', 'Bummer about the job, but enjoy the hiatus.  What comes next is an adventure - always is!  I like the shot because it''s real - not overdone, not oversaturated.  And don''t not do flowers unless you don''t want to, because you have a rare gift for portraying emotion with flowers - lots of people try, but for some reason, you pull it off better than anyone.  You could skip the net shots, though.  :-)', '2007-12-09 13:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303477, 618197, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 20!  Glad to see these do well for you.  Really good job with the lighting and set up, and with the editing.  You have a very good eye for very pleasing graphic presentations, and a whole lotta skill in creating a professional, finished look in post processing.  (All that said, this reminds me a bit of He Who Will Not Be Named...)</td>', 'Congrats on the top 20!  Glad to see these do well for you.  Really good job with the lighting and set up, and with the editing.  You have a very good eye for very pleasing graphic presentations, and a whole lotta skill in creating a professional, finished look in post processing.  (All that said, this reminds me a bit of He Who Will Not Be Named...)', '2007-12-09 13:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303487, 618443, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Does he know you entered this?  He''s a good looking young man - use him as a model more often.</td>', 'Heh!  Does he know you entered this?  He''s a good looking young man - use him as a model more often.', '2007-12-09 13:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303490, 617812, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome job of capturing the maternal instinct here - the softness of the processing really adds to that, too.</td>', 'Awesome job of capturing the maternal instinct here - the softness of the processing really adds to that, too.', '2007-12-09 13:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303492, 614416, 30982, '<td valign="top">Huh?  I apparently have no taste - I thought this was terrific.  Understated and elegant.  Nice work my dear!</td>', 'Huh?  I apparently have no taste - I thought this was terrific.  Understated and elegant.  Nice work my dear!', '2007-12-09 13:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303514, 615604, 30982, '<td valign="top">This struck me as a little flat - both in terms of contrast and light, and to some extent composition.  I like the elements of the foreground weeds (I''m trying to get shots of those here, believe it or not) and the red barn - red barns are always photogenic.</td>', 'This struck me as a little flat - both in terms of contrast and light, and to some extent composition.  I like the elements of the foreground weeds (I''m trying to get shots of those here, believe it or not) and the red barn - red barns are always photogenic.', '2007-12-09 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
