(4327894, 616087, 24073, '<td valign="top">I''ve made a pact with myself, since I screwed up the order of things in the thread, I''m leaving some comments...This being the first.<br/> <br/>I really like this photo, and if you have this model on a continuous basis, you should work with her more.  Having said that, I think her hair should have more light or dodged PP, I don''t like it fading into black, but of course that could just be personal preference.<br/> <br/>I like her form, stance, or posture it is well thought of, and her lipstick has good flash, and you seemed to of executed the right tones, and the light seems perfect aside from not enough on her hair.</td>', 'I''ve made a pact with myself, since I screwed up the order of things in the thread, I''m leaving some comments...This being the first. I really like this photo, and if you have this model on a continuous basis, you should work with her more.  Having said that, I think her hair should have more light or dodged PP, I don''t like it fading into black, but of course that could just be personal preference. I like her form, stance, or posture it is well thought of, and her lipstick has good flash, and you seemed to of executed the right tones, and the light seems perfect aside from not enough on her hair.', '2007-12-21 10:40:13.000000', NULL, 0),
